{"id": "fdcf9076", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "For coaching duties, Joe Thurston will fill in as the first base coach. Trent Blank will help out in the bullpen coaching role. Hugh Quattlebaum will help with the hitting coach duties with Jarret DeHart", "tokens": ["For", "coaching", "duties", ",", "Joe", "Thurston", "will", "fill", "in", "as", "the", "first", "base", "coach", ".", "Trent", "Blank", "will", "help", "out", "in", "the", "bullpen", "coaching", "role", ".", "Hugh", "Quattlebaum", "will", "help", "with", "the", "hitting", "coach", "duties", "with", "Jarret", "DeHart"], "token_idx": 22, "text_start": 105, "text_end": 112, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The Rays have lowest team ERA in AL and lowest bullpen ERA and no pitchers in the All-Star game. Rays are revolutionizing the way the game can be played. How many will follow?", "tokens": ["The", "Rays", "have", "lowest", "team", "ERA", "in", "AL", "and", "lowest", "bullpen", "ERA", "and", "no", "pitchers", "in", "the", "All-Star", "game", ".", "Rays", "are", "revolutionizing", "the", "way", "the", "game", "can", "be", "played", ".", "How", "many", "will", "follow", "?"], "token_idx": 10, "text_start": 47, "text_end": 54, "date": "2021-06"}}
{"id": "3005f1af", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "If any of the homies on twitter went to the cardfight vanguard sneak peak and got an SP granblue pack (nightrose) hmu \ud83d\udc40 ill buy / trade for it", "tokens": ["If", "any", "of", "the", "homies", "on", "twitter", "went", "to", "the", "cardfight", "vanguard", "sneak", "peak", "and", "got", "an", "SP", "granblue", "pack", "(", "nightrose", ")", "hmu", "\ud83d\udc40", "ill", "buy", "/", "trade", "for", "it"], "token_idx": 11, "text_start": 54, "text_end": 62, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Thanks to everyone for tuning last night! After almost finishing Vault of Glass we managed to finish it with some irl homies. Tonight I'll most likely either finish the raid with the initial team or farm strikes to reset the vanguard rank or farm Iron Banner gear to lvl up.", "tokens": ["Thanks", "to", "everyone", "for", "tuning", "last", "night", "!", "After", "almost", "finishing", "Vault", "of", "Glass", "we", "managed", "to", "finish", "it", "with", "some", "irl", "homies", ".", "Tonight", "I'll", "most", "likely", "either", "finish", "the", "raid", "with", "the", "initial", "team", "or", "farm", "strikes", "to", "reset", "the", "vanguard", "rank", "or", "farm", "Iron", "Banner", "gear", "to", "lvl", "up", "."], "token_idx": 42, "text_start": 225, "text_end": 233, "date": "2021-09"}}
