{"id": "a8bc4ec1", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "When Luke makes that pyre for Vader, I just thought of how easy it must have been to cut the wood with his lightsabre for it.", "tokens": ["When", "Luke", "makes", "that", "pyre", "for", "Vader", ",", "I", "just", "thought", "of", "how", "easy", "it", "must", "have", "been", "to", "cut", "the", "wood", "with", "his", "lightsabre", "for", "it", "."], "token_idx": 4, "text_start": 21, "text_end": 25, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "This morning the GOP, formerly a serious political party, chose to make itself a laughingstock. It self-immolated on a pyre of lies. What an ignoble way to die!", "tokens": ["This", "morning", "the", "GOP", ",", "formerly", "a", "serious", "political", "party", ",", "chose", "to", "make", "itself", "a", "laughingstock", ".", "It", "self-immolated", "on", "a", "pyre", "of", "lies", ".", "What", "an", "ignoble", "way", "to", "die", "!"], "token_idx": 22, "text_start": 119, "text_end": 123, "date": "2021-04"}}
