{"id": "5816ad7d", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Relate to us, Muse, the wandering of constant suffering that resulted in an abnormal funeral pyre for cow-eyed Antilochus.", "tokens": ["Relate", "to", "us", ",", "Muse", ",", "the", "wandering", "of", "constant", "suffering", "that", "resulted", "in", "an", "abnormal", "funeral", "pyre", "for", "cow-eyed", "Antilochus", "."], "token_idx": 17, "text_start": 93, "text_end": 97, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Playing God of War for the first time since its original release and it's really grown on me what a really masterful work of art it is. All the patient moments in the opening scene of the funeral pyre, Kratos' weariness, grief, and anxiety- it's magnificent still.", "tokens": ["Playing", "God", "of", "War", "for", "the", "first", "time", "since", "its", "original", "release", "and", "it's", "really", "grown", "on", "me", "what", "a", "really", "masterful", "work", "of", "art", "it", "is", ".", "All", "the", "patient", "moments", "in", "the", "opening", "scene", "of", "the", "funeral", "pyre", ",", "Kratos", "'", "weariness", ",", "grief", ",", "and", "anxiety", "-", "it's", "magnificent", "still", "."], "token_idx": 39, "text_start": 196, "text_end": 200, "date": "2021-04"}}
