{"id": "1f098bf0", "word": "moxie", "tweet1": {"text": "Gotta hand it to the AT&amp;T agent that tried to sell me internet services at the end of a cellular support debacle that spanned 2 hours and 5 reps. Takes moxie.", "tokens": ["Gotta", "hand", "it", "to", "the", "AT", "&", "T", "agent", "that", "tried", "to", "sell", "me", "internet", "services", "at", "the", "end", "of", "a", "cellular", "support", "debacle", "that", "spanned", "2", "hours", "and", "5", "reps", ".", "Takes", "moxie", "."], "token_idx": 33, "text_start": 156, "text_end": 161, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It's so funny to me that when moxie came out my tl was full of so called feminists who felt empowered . I wanna see the same energy from those people now to use your voice. there are Muslim women who need our help, don't be silent!!", "tokens": ["It's", "so", "funny", "to", "me", "that", "when", "moxie", "came", "out", "my", "tl", "was", "full", "of", "so", "called", "feminists", "who", "felt", "empowered", ".", "I", "wanna", "see", "the", "same", "energy", "from", "those", "people", "now", "to", "use", "your", "voice", ".", "there", "are", "Muslim", "women", "who", "need", "our", "help", ",", "don't", "be", "silent", "!", "!"], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 30, "text_end": 35, "date": "2021-03"}}
