{"id": "7c19529b", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "If I had the last decade of my memory ripped from me, I would absolutely believe this is a high-potency, low-concept strain of vanguard reality tv/game show where they just make two Octogenarians fight for a table at Old Country Buffet w free bread on the line.", "tokens": ["If", "I", "had", "the", "last", "decade", "of", "my", "memory", "ripped", "from", "me", ",", "I", "would", "absolutely", "believe", "this", "is", "a", "high-potency", ",", "low-concept", "strain", "of", "vanguard", "reality", "tv", "/", "game", "show", "where", "they", "just", "make", "two", "Octogenarians", "fight", "for", "a", "table", "at", "Old", "Country", "Buffet", "w", "free", "bread", "on", "the", "line", "."], "token_idx": 25, "text_start": 127, "text_end": 135, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Artists have been recording (neo-)traditional country music since...forever. There are a number of interesting and important ones working today, but suggesting these artists are at the vanguard of a shift back to traditional sounds ignores decades of music.", "tokens": ["Artists", "have", "been", "recording", "(", "neo", "-", ")", "traditional", "country", "music", "since", "...", "forever", ".", "There", "are", "a", "number", "of", "interesting", "and", "important", "ones", "working", "today", ",", "but", "suggesting", "these", "artists", "are", "at", "the", "vanguard", "of", "a", "shift", "back", "to", "traditional", "sounds", "ignores", "decades", "of", "music", "."], "token_idx": 34, "text_start": 185, "text_end": 193, "date": "2021-09"}}
