{"id": "7de3b8e7", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "A Queens Affair: how two bloviating douchebags mishandled a crisis, turning their hometown borough into a funeral pyre. Who plays whom in the play?", "tokens": ["A", "Queens", "Affair", ":", "how", "two", "bloviating", "douchebags", "mishandled", "a", "crisis", ",", "turning", "their", "hometown", "borough", "into", "a", "funeral", "pyre", ".", "Who", "plays", "whom", "in", "the", "play", "?"], "token_idx": 19, "text_start": 114, "text_end": 118, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I have built my funeral pyre and I'm ready to light it. I have therapy tomorrow but I cancelled my psychiatrist appointment that my therapist thought I would be going to and I just never rescheduled it, so it's time to prepare the best lie I can muster", "tokens": ["I", "have", "built", "my", "funeral", "pyre", "and", "I'm", "ready", "to", "light", "it", ".", "I", "have", "therapy", "tomorrow", "but", "I", "cancelled", "my", "psychiatrist", "appointment", "that", "my", "therapist", "thought", "I", "would", "be", "going", "to", "and", "I", "just", "never", "rescheduled", "it", ",", "so", "it's", "time", "to", "prepare", "the", "best", "lie", "I", "can", "muster"], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 24, "text_end": 28, "date": "2021-04"}}
