{"id": "60dcc20c", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Dearest Listeners, Ginger's back has gone out and, as you might imagine, it is hard to research a podcast episode when you're high on muscle relaxers. We'll be back next week to foist another Dead Asshole (tm) onto the pyre for your amusement. Xoxo Ren \u2018n Gingy", "tokens": ["Dearest", "Listeners", ",", "Ginger's", "back", "has", "gone", "out", "and", ",", "as", "you", "might", "imagine", ",", "it", "is", "hard", "to", "research", "a", "podcast", "episode", "when", "you're", "high", "on", "muscle", "relaxers", ".", "We'll", "be", "back", "next", "week", "to", "foist", "another", "Dead", "Asshole", "(", "tm", ")", "onto", "the", "pyre", "for", "your", "amusement", ".", "Xoxo", "Ren", "\u2018", "n", "Gingy"], "token_idx": 45, "text_start": 219, "text_end": 223, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It was raining unusually heavy that day, under the makeshift roof the pyre was burning. It was just one among thousands. He stood there drenched, watching the flames dance under the roofs shade, the dark smoke trying hard to escape out, the rain hiding his cries. It was she who", "tokens": ["It", "was", "raining", "unusually", "heavy", "that", "day", ",", "under", "the", "makeshift", "roof", "the", "pyre", "was", "burning", ".", "It", "was", "just", "one", "among", "thousands", ".", "He", "stood", "there", "drenched", ",", "watching", "the", "flames", "dance", "under", "the", "roofs", "shade", ",", "the", "dark", "smoke", "trying", "hard", "to", "escape", "out", ",", "the", "rain", "hiding", "his", "cries", ".", "It", "was", "she", "who"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 70, "text_end": 74, "date": "2021-04"}}
{"id": "3740d183", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "#IliadStats At \u03a4 258-265 (Book 19), Agamemnon swears an oath that he has not touched Briseis; and although we see him again at Patroclus's pyre, as well as at the funeral games, he will not say another word in the remainder of the Iliad.", "tokens": ["#IliadStats", "At", "\u03a4", "258-265", "(", "Book", "19", ")", ",", "Agamemnon", "swears", "an", "oath", "that", "he", "has", "not", "touched", "Briseis", ";", "and", "although", "we", "see", "him", "again", "at", "Patroclus's", "pyre", ",", "as", "well", "as", "at", "the", "funeral", "games", ",", "he", "will", "not", "say", "another", "word", "in", "the", "remainder", "of", "the", "Iliad", "."], "token_idx": 28, "text_start": 139, "text_end": 143, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "This morning the GOP, formerly a serious political party, chose to make itself a laughingstock. It self-immolated on a pyre of lies. What an ignoble way to die!", "tokens": ["This", "morning", "the", "GOP", ",", "formerly", "a", "serious", "political", "party", ",", "chose", "to", "make", "itself", "a", "laughingstock", ".", "It", "self-immolated", "on", "a", "pyre", "of", "lies", ".", "What", "an", "ignoble", "way", "to", "die", "!"], "token_idx": 22, "text_start": 119, "text_end": 123, "date": "2021-04"}}
