{"id": "9d4819e2", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Y'all a maga boomer retweeted my angst about unemployment and I want to mcfuckin die. Just to set the record straight: I'm a raging lesbian socialist who wants nothing more then to set capitalism ablaze with trump on top of the pyre. You don't get to come here", "tokens": ["Y'all", "a", "maga", "boomer", "retweeted", "my", "angst", "about", "unemployment", "and", "I", "want", "to", "mcfuckin", "die", ".", "Just", "to", "set", "the", "record", "straight", ":", "I'm", "a", "raging", "lesbian", "socialist", "who", "wants", "nothing", "more", "then", "to", "set", "capitalism", "ablaze", "with", "trump", "on", "top", "of", "the", "pyre", ".", "You", "don't", "get", "to", "come", "here"], "token_idx": 43, "text_start": 228, "text_end": 232, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "We stand around the pyre, The remainder of the fire, From which pokes the carcass that was once your house. It's unclear how it began, But it's clear that we all ran, All except your tied-up, now departed spouse.", "tokens": ["We", "stand", "around", "the", "pyre", ",", "The", "remainder", "of", "the", "fire", ",", "From", "which", "pokes", "the", "carcass", "that", "was", "once", "your", "house", ".", "It's", "unclear", "how", "it", "began", ",", "But", "it's", "clear", "that", "we", "all", "ran", ",", "All", "except", "your", "tied-up", ",", "now", "departed", "spouse", "."], "token_idx": 4, "text_start": 20, "text_end": 24, "date": "2021-04"}}
