{"id": "a5fb3382", "word": "moxie", "tweet1": {"text": "What gives me hope during the Coronavirus outbreak? Our resiliency as human beings. Our toughness. Our moxie. Sure, they may be cancelling large events across the world, but that doesn't stop gatherings of ten, twenty, even FIFTY people every night at your mom's house.", "tokens": ["What", "gives", "me", "hope", "during", "the", "Coronavirus", "outbreak", "?", "Our", "resiliency", "as", "human", "beings", ".", "Our", "toughness", ".", "Our", "moxie", ".", "Sure", ",", "they", "may", "be", "cancelling", "large", "events", "across", "the", "world", ",", "but", "that", "doesn't", "stop", "gatherings", "of", "ten", ",", "twenty", ",", "even", "FIFTY", "people", "every", "night", "at", "your", "mom's", "house", "."], "token_idx": 19, "text_start": 103, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "From a personal point of view, I (Rebel) first met Rosie when she was the #OTLFP guest. She was so beautiful and she had such moxie; I fell in love on the spot. #OTLFP @GregariousGus #RosiesLimo", "tokens": ["From", "a", "personal", "point", "of", "view", ",", "I", "(", "Rebel", ")", "first", "met", "Rosie", "when", "she", "was", "the", "#OTLFP", "guest", ".", "She", "was", "so", "beautiful", "and", "she", "had", "such", "moxie", ";", "I", "fell", "in", "love", "on", "the", "spot", ".", "#OTLFP", "@GregariousGus", "#RosiesLimo"], "token_idx": 29, "text_start": 126, "text_end": 131, "date": "2021-03"}}
