{"id": "bdba3273", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "When a widow women can be burned alive in Sati Rasam (woman burns to death on her husband's funeral pyre) they can humiliate then #SafooraZargar tooThey have no idea of respect Dear Sanghis please be human &amp; do not commit mistakes #\u0938\u092b\u0942\u0930\u093e_\u091c\u0930\u0917\u0930_\u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940_\u092c\u0939\u0928_\u0939\u0948 #\u0917\u0926\u094d\u0926\u093e\u0930_\u092e\u094b\u0926\u0940_\u0932\u0941\u091f\u0947\u0930\u093e_\u0939\u0948", "tokens": ["When", "a", "widow", "women", "can", "be", "burned", "alive", "in", "Sati", "Rasam", "(", "woman", "burns", "to", "death", "on", "her", "husband's", "funeral", "pyre", ")", "they", "can", "humiliate", "then", "#SafooraZargar", "tooThey", "have", "no", "idea", "of", "respect", "Dear", "Sanghis", "please", "be", "human", "&", "do", "not", "commit", "mistakes", "#\u0938\u092b\u0942\u0930\u093e_\u091c\u0930\u0917\u0930_\u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940_\u092c\u0939\u0928_\u0939\u0948", "#\u0917\u0926\u094d\u0926\u093e\u0930_\u092e\u094b\u0926\u0940_\u0932\u0941\u091f\u0947\u0930\u093e_\u0939\u0948"], "token_idx": 20, "text_start": 100, "text_end": 104, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Playing God of War for the first time since its original release and it's really grown on me what a really masterful work of art it is. All the patient moments in the opening scene of the funeral pyre, Kratos' weariness, grief, and anxiety- it's magnificent still.", "tokens": ["Playing", "God", "of", "War", "for", "the", "first", "time", "since", "its", "original", "release", "and", "it's", "really", "grown", "on", "me", "what", "a", "really", "masterful", "work", "of", "art", "it", "is", ".", "All", "the", "patient", "moments", "in", "the", "opening", "scene", "of", "the", "funeral", "pyre", ",", "Kratos", "'", "weariness", ",", "grief", ",", "and", "anxiety", "-", "it's", "magnificent", "still", "."], "token_idx": 39, "text_start": 196, "text_end": 200, "date": "2021-0