{"id": "54eb6b63", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "There is an endless struggle in balancing screen space vs. clarity in UI design. When you're tight for space, you end up with small, abstract, unlabeled affordances. When you have more space, you can use descriptive words. To improve clarity, make space by refactoring the UI.", "tokens": ["There", "is", "an", "endless", "struggle", "in", "balancing", "screen", "space", "vs", ".", "clarity", "in", "UI", "design", ".", "When", "you're", "tight", "for", "space", ",", "you", "end", "up", "with", "small", ",", "abstract", ",", "unlabeled", "affordances", ".", "When", "you", "have", "more", "space", ",", "you", "can", "use", "descriptive", "words", ".", "To", "improve", "clarity", ",", "make", "space", "by", "refactoring", "the", "UI", "."], "token_idx": 30, "text_start": 143, "text_end": 152, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "a reminder that im unlabeled n am happiest that way :-)", "tokens": ["a", "reminder", "that", "im", "unlabeled", "n", "am", "happiest", "that", "way", ":-)"], "token_idx": 4, "text_start": 19, "text_end": 28, "date": "2021-03"}}
