{"id": "83d2aaf0", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "\"We shall make a pyre of this city, and there shall be no weeping for its passing, for none will remain to weep\" - Dalinar Kholin, the most badass motherfucker in fiction", "tokens": ["\"", "We", "shall", "make", "a", "pyre", "of", "this", "city", ",", "and", "there", "shall", "be", "no", "weeping", "for", "its", "passing", ",", "for", "none", "will", "remain", "to", "weep", "\"", "-", "Dalinar", "Kholin", ",", "the", "most", "badass", "motherfucker", "in", "fiction"], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 17, "text_end": 21, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Respect our dead? Yeah we respect our dead enough to want justice for them. For them to be counted in gross mismanagement of this pandemic. Each pyre and coffin is not a stat, each of them were people, people who deserved a chance to survive, whose families deserved more.", "tokens": ["Respect", "our", "dead", "?", "Yeah", "we", "respect", "our", "dead", "enough", "to", "want", "justice", "for", "them", ".", "For", "them", "to", "be", "counted", "in", "gross", "mismanagement", "of", "this", "pandemic", ".", "Each", "pyre", "and", "coffin", "is", "not", "a", "stat", ",", "each", "of", "them", "were", "people", ",", "people", "who", "deserved", "a", "chance", "to", "survive", ",", "whose", "families", "deserved", "more", "."], "token_idx": 29, "text_start": 145, "text_end": 149, "date": "2021-04"}}
