{"id": "cf9a25e3", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Bored in the bullpen leads to some very weird conversations.", "tokens": ["Bored", "in", "the", "bullpen", "leads", "to", "some", "very", "weird", "conversations", "."], "token_idx": 3, "text_start": 13, "text_end": 20, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Angels should consider trading for Paul Fry and/or Tyler Wells if they want to compete this year. Bolster that bullpen with fresh arms. Wells is lowkey sick and Fry's had good numbers so far; both have potential and would definitely help our bullpen.", "tokens": ["Angels", "should", "consider", "trading", "for", "Paul", "Fry", "and", "/", "or", "Tyler", "Wells", "if", "they", "want", "to", "compete", "this", "year", ".", "Bolster", "that", "bullpen", "with", "fresh", "arms", ".", "Wells", "is", "lowkey", "sick", "and", "Fry's", "had", "good", "numbers", "so", "far", ";", "both", "have", "potential", "and", "would", "definitely", "help", "our", "bullpen", "."], "token_idx": 22, "text_start": 111, "text_end": 118, "date": "2021-06"}}
