{"id": "424e985c", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "Robinhood doesn't matter, it never moved this market, they're scraping the fish tank walls ... chill out on SoftBank conspiracy they replaced equity positions with options as @bennpeifert reducing their net delta ... And don't console yourself with \"froth\" cleansing narrative", "tokens": ["Robinhood", "doesn't", "matter", ",", "it", "never", "moved", "this", "market", ",", "they're", "scraping", "the", "fish", "tank", "walls", "...", "chill", "out", "on", "SoftBank", "conspiracy", "they", "replaced", "equity", "positions", "with", "options", "as", "@bennpeifert", "reducing", "their", "net", "delta", "...", "And", "don't", "console", "yourself", "with", "\"", "froth", "\"", "cleansing", "narrative"], "token_idx": 33, "text_start": 207, "text_end": 212, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I read today that the delta variant of COVID is about 60% more transmissable than the alpha, or original, version of the disease. On average, someone with the alpha will give the disease to 2.5 people. With delta? About six.", "tokens": ["I", "read", "today", "that", "the", "delta", "variant", "of", "COVID", "is", "about", "60", "%", "more", "transmissable", "than", "the", "alpha", ",", "or", "original", ",", "version", "of", "the", "disease", ".", "On", "average", ",", "someone", "with", "the", "alpha", "will", "give", "the", "disease", "to", "2.5", "people", ".", "With", "delta", "?", "About", "six", "."], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 22, "text_end": 27, "date": "2021-08"}}
