{"id": "5721f9ad", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "\"You live in the real world. You die in the material world, like every cell of the prism of form, sparks of the funeral pyre. Your being is immortal. It has not been born. Your body is mortal. It is already dead, the shadow of the light of your life.\" - Ancestor funeral rites.", "tokens": ["\"", "You", "live", "in", "the", "real", "world", ".", "You", "die", "in", "the", "material", "world", ",", "like", "every", "cell", "of", "the", "prism", "of", "form", ",", "sparks", "of", "the", "funeral", "pyre", ".", "Your", "being", "is", "immortal", ".", "It", "has", "not", "been", "born", ".", "Your", "body", "is", "mortal", ".", "It", "is", "already", "dead", ",", "the", "shadow", "of", "the", "light", "of", "your", "life", ".", "\"", "-", "Ancestor", "funeral", "rites", "."], "token_idx": 28, "text_start": 120, "text_end": 124, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "To all the fanatic Muslim haters.. Videos and reports of so many Hindu dead souls, abandoned by their own families, with no one coming forward to cremate the body. Here Muslims have stepped forward, lifted the pyre on their shoulders, and cremated the body with full Hindu rituals", "tokens": ["To", "all", "the", "fanatic", "Muslim", "haters", "..", "Videos", "and", "reports", "of", "so", "many", "Hindu", "dead", "souls", ",", "abandoned", "by", "their", "own", "families", ",", "with", "no", "one", "coming", "forward", "to", "cremate", "the", "body", ".", "Here", "Muslims", "have", "stepped", "forward", ",", "lifted", "the", "pyre", "on", "their", "shoulders", ",", "and", "cremated", "the", "body", "with", "full", "Hindu", "rituals"], "token_idx": 41, "text_start": 210, "text_end": 214, "date": "2021-04"}}
