{"id": "33847051", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "When i die i don't wanna be buried i wanna be burned on a pyre", "tokens": ["When", "i", "die", "i", "don't", "wanna", "be", "buried", "i", "wanna", "be", "burned", "on", "a", "pyre"], "token_idx": 14, "text_start": 58, "text_end": 62, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "When this pandemic is over, the world will be split into 2 types of people - For some it'd be a memory of a strenuous time, one marred by death and desperation. For some - it'll only be the faces that remain. The ones they held while gasping, the ones they caressed on the pyre.", "tokens": ["When", "this", "pandemic", "is", "over", ",", "the", "world", "will", "be", "split", "into", "2", "types", "of", "people", "-", "For", "some", "it'd", "be", "a", "memory", "of", "a", "strenuous", "time", ",", "one", "marred", "by", "death", "and", "desperation", ".", "For", "some", "-", "it'll", "only", "be", "the", "faces", "that", "remain", ".", "The", "ones", "they", "held", "while", "gasping", ",", "the", "ones", "they", "caressed", "on", "the", "pyre", "."], "token_idx": 59, "text_start": 273, "text_end": 277, "date": "2021-04"}}
