{"id": "01fad832", "word": "gala", "tweet1": {"text": "Today marks what ought to have been the opening night gala of the @MetOpera this evening. As so many artists and the crews that bring opera to the stage face another season of uncertainty while other industries are allowed to reopen, please say a prayer for our beloved artists.", "tokens": ["Today", "marks", "what", "ought", "to", "have", "been", "the", "opening", "night", "gala", "of", "the", "@MetOpera", "this", "evening", ".", "As", "so", "many", "artists", "and", "the", "crews", "that", "bring", "opera", "to", "the", "stage", "face", "another", "season", "of", "uncertainty", "while", "other", "industries", "are", "allowed", "to", "reopen", ",", "please", "say", "a", "prayer", "for", "our", "beloved", "artists", "."], "token_idx": 10, "text_start": 54, "text_end": 58, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "What do y'all think about a royale high met gala? \ud83d\udc40 me and @CrimsonCrimes_ are planning it up! and we will invite some of your favorite royale high idols! who do you want to see there? \ud83e\udd0d", "tokens": ["What", "do", "y'all", "think", "about", "a", "royale", "high", "met", "gala", "?", "\ud83d\udc40", "me", "and", "@CrimsonCrimes_", "are", "planning", "it", "up", "!", "and", "we", "will", "invite", "some", "of", "your", "favorite", "royale", "high", "idols", "!", "who", "do", "you", "want", "to", "see", "there", "?", "\ud83e\udd0d"], "token_idx": 9, "text_start": 44, "text_end": 48, "date": "2021-09"}}
