{"id": "f7add8e7", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "1990 I went to Nigambodh Ghat crematorium Delhi on a chilly winter night for D cremation of a friend's little daughter While we waited for D necessary arrangements, I saw some cremation ground workers prepare tea in a metal lota with long iron handle on an adjacent burning pyre", "tokens": ["1990", "I", "went", "to", "Nigambodh", "Ghat", "crematorium", "Delhi", "on", "a", "chilly", "winter", "night", "for", "D", "cremation", "of", "a", "friend's", "little", "daughter", "While", "we", "waited", "for", "D", "necessary", "arrangements", ",", "I", "saw", "some", "cremation", "ground", "workers", "prepare", "tea", "in", "a", "metal", "lota", "with", "long", "iron", "handle", "on", "an", "adjacent", "burning", "pyre"], "token_idx": 49, "text_start": 274, "text_end": 278, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "To all the fanatic Muslim haters.. Videos and reports of so many Hindu dead souls, abandoned by their own families, with no one coming forward to cremate the body. Here Muslims have stepped forward, lifted the pyre on their shoulders, and cremated the body with full Hindu rituals", "tokens": ["To", "all", "the", "fanatic", "Muslim", "haters", "..", "Videos", "and", "reports", "of", "so", "many", "Hindu", "dead", "souls", ",", "abandoned", "by", "their", "own", "families", ",", "with", "no", "one", "coming", "forward", "to", "cremate", "the", "body", ".", "Here", "Muslims", "have", "stepped", "forward", ",", "lifted", "the", "pyre", "on", "their", "shoulders", ",", "and", "cremated", "the", "body", "with", "full", "Hindu", "rituals"], "token_idx": 41, "text_start": 210, "text_end": 214, "date": "2021-04"}}
