{"id": "e2866601", "word": "gala", "tweet1": {"text": "I can't be the only one that likes to microwave gala and bread \ud83d\ude2c", "tokens": ["I", "can't", "be", "the", "only", "one", "that", "likes", "to", "microwave", "gala", "and", "bread", "\ud83d\ude2c"], "token_idx": 10, "text_start": 48, "text_end": 52, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I was invited as a guest to a gala honoring some local do-gooders. No lie, these people are among the finest and most selfless I know. But as usual, I've nothing to wear. Fortunately I think I've enough earthy and artsy cred around here to get away with showing up in whatever.\ud83e\udd74", "tokens": ["I", "was", "invited", "as", "a", "guest", "to", "a", "gala", "honoring", "some", "local", "do-gooders", ".", "No", "lie", ",", "these", "people", "are", "among", "the", "finest", "and", "most", "selfless", "I", "know", ".", "But", "as", "usual", ",", "I've", "nothing", "to", "wear", ".", "Fortunately", "I", "think", "I've", "enough", "earthy", "and", "artsy", "cred", "around", "here", "to", "get", "away", "with", "showing", "up", "in", "whatever", ".", "\ud83e\udd74"], "token_idx": 8, "text_start": 30, "text_end": 34, "date": "2021-09"}}
