{"id": "42700455", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "When Luke makes that pyre for Vader, I just thought of how easy it must have been to cut the wood with his lightsabre for it.", "tokens": ["When", "Luke", "makes", "that", "pyre", "for", "Vader", ",", "I", "just", "thought", "of", "how", "easy", "it", "must", "have", "been", "to", "cut", "the", "wood", "with", "his", "lightsabre", "for", "it", "."], "token_idx": 4, "text_start": 21, "text_end": 25, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "In Rajasthan's Barmer district, a 34-year-old woman jumped into the burning pyre of her father, who died of Corona, on Tuesday. In a critical condition with 70% burns, she was first taken to the local government hospital, which referred her to Jodhpur after preliminary treatment.", "tokens": ["In", "Rajasthan's", "Barmer", "district", ",", "a", "34", "-", "year-old", "woman", "jumped", "into", "the", "burning", "pyre", "of", "her", "father", ",", "who", "died", "of", "Corona", ",", "on", "Tuesday", ".", "In", "a", "critical", "condition", "with", "70", "%", "burns", ",", "she", "was", "first", "taken", "to", "the", "local", "government", "hospital", ",", "which", "referred", "her", "to", "Jodhpur", "after", "preliminary", "treatment", "."], "token_idx": 14, "text_start": 76, "text_end": 80, "date": "2021-04"}}
