{"id": "9c601f6e", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "when hozier said \"if I was born as a blackthorn tree, i'd wanna be felled by you, held by you, fuel the pyre of your enemies\" and when wwx said \"if i have to die, let it be by your hand, that would be enough\"", "tokens": ["when", "hozier", "said", "\"", "if", "I", "was", "born", "as", "a", "blackthorn", "tree", ",", "i'd", "wanna", "be", "felled", "by", "you", ",", "held", "by", "you", ",", "fuel", "the", "pyre", "of", "your", "enemies", "\"", "and", "when", "wwx", "said", "\"", "if", "i", "have", "to", "die", ",", "let", "it", "be", "by", "your", "hand", ",", "that", "would", "be", "enough", "\""], "token_idx": 26, "text_start": 104, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It's true that both rock salt and pyrite have cubic crystals and symbolize the realm of Earth. But pyrite also has a Fire element, seen by the 'pyre' within its name!", "tokens": ["It's", "true", "that", "both", "rock", "salt", "and", "pyrite", "have", "cubic", "crystals", "and", "symbolize", "the", "realm", "of", "Earth", ".", "But", "pyrite", "also", "has", "a", "Fire", "element", ",", "seen", "by", "the", "'", "pyre", "'", "within", "its", "name", "!"], "token_idx": 30, "text_start": 144, "text_end": 148, "date": "2021-04"}}
