{"id": "64d24f0e", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Some people choose to see the ugliness in this world. I choose to see the beauty. Value those precious moments of empathy, remember the meaning of life. Even as the world burns to cinders like a pyre, be a beacon of hope, a guide in the dark, a lighthouse. I believe in you. \ud83d\udd25", "tokens": ["Some", "people", "choose", "to", "see", "the", "ugliness", "in", "this", "world", ".", "I", "choose", "to", "see", "the", "beauty", ".", "Value", "those", "precious", "moments", "of", "empathy", ",", "remember", "the", "meaning", "of", "life", ".", "Even", "as", "the", "world", "burns", "to", "cinders", "like", "a", "pyre", ",", "be", "a", "beacon", "of", "hope", ",", "a", "guide", "in", "the", "dark", ",", "a", "lighthouse", ".", "I", "believe", "in", "you", ".", "\ud83d\udd25"], "token_idx": 40, "text_start": 195, "text_end": 199, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "If someone learns to do TV journalism, then learn from Indian journalists like creating an atmosphere of fear fear in the society. You should be ashamed of what you want to prove by showing burning pyre.", "tokens": ["If", "someone", "learns", "to", "do", "TV", "journalism", ",", "then", "learn", "from", "Indian", "journalists", "like", "creating", "an", "atmosphere", "of", "fear", "fear", "in", "the", "society", ".", "You", "should", "be", "ashamed", "of", "what", "you", "want", "to", "prove", "by", "showing", "burning", "pyre", "."], "token_idx": 37, "text_start": 198, "text_end": 202, "date": "2021-04"}}
