{"id": "58328018", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "Rank on rank the host of heaven spreads its vanguard on the way, as the Light of Light descendeth from the realms of endless day, that the powers of hell may vanish as the darkness clears away.", "tokens": ["Rank", "on", "rank", "the", "host", "of", "heaven", "spreads", "its", "vanguard", "on", "the", "way", ",", "as", "the", "Light", "of", "Light", "descendeth", "from", "the", "realms", "of", "endless", "day", ",", "that", "the", "powers", "of", "hell", "may", "vanish", "as", "the", "darkness", "clears", "away", "."], "token_idx": 9, "text_start": 44, "text_end": 52, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Artists have been recording (neo-)traditional country music since...forever. There are a number of interesting and important ones working today, but suggesting these artists are at the vanguard of a shift back to traditional sounds ignores decades of music.", "tokens": ["Artists", "have", "been", "recording", "(", "neo", "-", ")", "traditional", "country", "music", "since", "...", "forever", ".", "There", "are", "a", "number", "of", "interesting", "and", "important", "ones", "working", "today", ",", "but", "suggesting", "these", "artists", "are", "at", "the", "vanguard", "of", "a", "shift", "back", "to", "traditional", "sounds", "ignores", "decades", "of", "music", "."], "token_idx": 34, "text_start": 185, "text_end": 193, "date": "2021-09"}}
