{"id": "b27770b2", "word": "gaza", "tweet1": {"text": "If Hamas and Fatah didn't clash Israel wouldn't be like the way they are today. People always forget that. I thought of this ever since I'm in high school. But it's controversial. Yes no denying the cruelty of Israel to the gaza strip people. It's inhumane.", "tokens": ["If", "Hamas", "and", "Fatah", "didn't", "clash", "Israel", "wouldn't", "be", "like", "the", "way", "they", "are", "today", ".", "People", "always", "forget", "that", ".", "I", "thought", "of", "this", "ever", "since", "I'm", "in", "high", "school", ".", "But", "it's", "controversial", ".", "Yes", "no", "denying", "the", "cruelty", "of", "Israel", "to", "the", "gaza", "strip", "people", ".", "It's", "inhumane", "."], "token_idx": 45, "text_start": 224, "text_end": 228, "date": "2020-05"}, "tweet2": {"text": "1. 1948 UN partition of Arab State and Jewish State 2. The jews accepted and declared independence, the birth of Israel as a sovereign country 3. The arabs rejected and went to war, jordan took west bank while egypt took gaza until 1967", "tokens": ["1", ".", "1948", "UN", "partition", "of", "Arab", "State", "and", "Jewish", "State", "2", ".", "The", "jews", "accepted", "and", "declared", "independence", ",", "the", "birth", "of", "Israel", "as", "a", "sovereign", "country", "3", ".", "The", "arabs", "rejected", "and", "went", "to", "war", ",", "jordan", "took", "west", "bank", "while", "egypt", "took", "gaza", "until", "1967"], "token_idx": 45, "text_start": 221, "text_end": 225, "date": "2021-05"}}
{"id": "70c48baf", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "ok, tell the guy who was collecting wood for the pyre to stop... my schedules are officially upside-down again! xD this is crazy... holy molly... 1 week normal, 1 week inverted \ud83d\ude42\ud83d\ude43\ud83d\ude42\ud83d\ude43\ud83e\udd74\ud83e\udd74\ud83e\udd74", "tokens": ["ok", ",", "tell", "the", "guy", "who", "was", "collecting", "wood", "for", "the", "pyre", "to", "stop", "...", "my", "schedules", "are", "officially", "upside-down", "again", "!", "xD", "this", "is", "crazy", "...", "holy", "molly", "...", "1", "week", "normal", ",", "1", "week", "inverted", "\ud83d\ude42", "\ud83d\ude43", "\ud83d\ude42", "\ud83d\ude43", "\ud83e\udd74", "\ud83e\udd74", "\ud83e\udd74"], "token_idx": 11, "text_start": 49, "text_end": 53, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "So the #VultureJournalists spring into action because of #CongressToolKit Tells you all bike riding alleged \"journalist\", why only some states which are election bound were their focus when the death and funeral pyre was all around us. You know which vultures bread these ones!", "tokens": ["So", "the", "#VultureJournalists", "spring", "into", "action", "because", "of", "#CongressToolKit", "Tells", "you", "all", "bike", "riding", "alleged", "\"", "journalist", "\"", ",", "why", "only", "some", "states", "which", "are", "election", "bound", "were", "their", "focus", "when", "the", "death", "and", "funeral", "pyre", "was", "all", "around", "us", ".", "You", "know", "which", "vultures", "bread", "these", "ones", "!"], "token_idx": 35, "text_start": 212, "text_end": 216, "date": "2021-04"}}
{"id": "94e1c015", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "\"You live in the real world. You die in the material world, like every cell of the prism of form, sparks of the funeral pyre. Your being is immortal. It has not been born. Your body is mortal. It is already dead, the shadow of the light of your life.\" - Ancestor funeral rites.", "tokens": ["\"", "You", "live", "in", "the", "real", "world", ".", "You", "die", "in", "the", "material", "world", ",", "like", "every", "cell", "of", "the", "prism", "of", "form", ",", "sparks", "of", "the", "funeral", "pyre", ".", "Your", "being", "is", "immortal", ".", "It", "has", "not", "been", "born", ".", "Your", "body", "is", "mortal", ".", "It", "is", "already", "dead", ",", "the", "shadow", "of", "the", "light", "of", "your", "life", ".", "\"", "-", "Ancestor", "funeral", "rites", "."], "token_idx": 28, "text_start": 120, "text_end": 124, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It was raining unusually heavy that day, under the makeshift roof the pyre was burning. It was just one among thousands. He stood there drenched, watching the flames dance under the roofs shade, the dark smoke trying hard to escape out, the rain hiding his cries. It was she who", "tokens": ["It", "was", "raining", "unusually", "heavy", "that", "day", ",", "under", "the", "makeshift", "roof", "the", "pyre", "was", "burning", ".", "It", "was", "just", "one", "among", "thousands", ".", "He", "stood", "there", "drenched", ",", "watching", "the", "flames", "dance", "under", "the", "roofs", "shade", ",", "the", "dark", "smoke", "trying", "hard", "to", "escape", "out", ",", "the", "rain", "hiding", "his", "cries", ".", "It", "was", "she", "who"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 70, "text_end": 74, "date": "2021-04"}}
