{"id": "241833f2", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "If anyone wants to come over later (from six feet away)I guess I'll be burning my @alisoneroman cookbooks on a pyre and building my shrine to @MarieKondo and @chrissyteigen. But seriously, can't we all just get along, empowered women?", "tokens": ["If", "anyone", "wants", "to", "come", "over", "later", "(", "from", "six", "feet", "away", ")", "I", "guess", "I'll", "be", "burning", "my", "@alisoneroman", "cookbooks", "on", "a", "pyre", "and", "building", "my", "shrine", "to", "@MarieKondo", "and", "@chrissyteigen", ".", "But", "seriously", ",", "can't", "we", "all", "just", "get", "along", ",", "empowered", "women", "?"], "token_idx": 23, "text_start": 111, "text_end": 115, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It will be inked in the pages of history with black letters that during Narendra Modi's rule Hindus in India had become so helpless that people even failed to afford a pyre for their dead ones.", "tokens": ["It", "will", "be", "inked", "in", "the", "pages", "of", "history", "with", "black", "letters", "that", "during", "Narendra", "Modi's", "rule", "Hindus", "in", "India", "had", "become", "so", "helpless", "that", "people", "even", "failed", "to", "afford", "a", "pyre", "for", "their", "dead", "ones", "."], "token_idx": 31, "text_start": 168, "text_end": 172, "date": "2021-04"}}
