{"id": "b3d03b40", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "Today is a big day for us at @ModzeroMedia I am in delta on a pitch and the crew is executing for a major client, an execution I have personally handled for over 3 years. This feels new and they will deliver perfectly.", "tokens": ["Today", "is", "a", "big", "day", "for", "us", "at", "@ModzeroMedia", "I", "am", "in", "delta", "on", "a", "pitch", "and", "the", "crew", "is", "executing", "for", "a", "major", "client", ",", "an", "execution", "I", "have", "personally", "handled", "for", "over", "3", "years", ".", "This", "feels", "new", "and", "they", "will", "deliver", "perfectly", "."], "token_idx": 12, "text_start": 51, "text_end": 56, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I am wondering why vaccine boosters don't carry the delta or other new variants as the flu shot has updates every year. I don't know the process for changing parts of vaccines for variants without restarting the entire approval process.", "tokens": ["I", "am", "wondering", "why", "vaccine", "boosters", "don't", "carry", "the", "delta", "or", "other", "new", "variants", "as", "the", "flu", "shot", "has", "updates", "every", "year", ".", "I", "don't", "know", "the", "process", "for", "changing", "parts", "of", "vaccines", "for", "variants", "without", "restarting", "the", "entire", "approval", "process", "."], "token_idx": 9, "text_start": 52, "text_end": 57, "date": "2021-08"}}
