{"id": "e950002b", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "\ud83d\udd25Isaiah 30:33\ud83d\udd25 For Topheth [the place of human sacrifice to Molech] has long been ready, Indeed, it has been prepared for the king. He has made it deep and large, A pyre of fire with plenty of wood; The breath of the Lord, like a torrent of brimstone, sets it afire.", "tokens": ["\ud83d\udd25", "Isaiah", "30:33", "\ud83d\udd25", "For", "Topheth", "[", "the", "place", "of", "human", "sacrifice", "to", "Molech", "]", "has", "long", "been", "ready", ",", "Indeed", ",", "it", "has", "been", "prepared", "for", "the", "king", ".", "He", "has", "made", "it", "deep", "and", "large", ",", "A", "pyre", "of", "fire", "with", "plenty", "of", "wood", ";", "The", "breath", "of", "the", "Lord", ",", "like", "a", "torrent", "of", "brimstone", ",", "sets", "it", "afire", "."], "token_idx": 39, "text_start": 165, "text_end": 169, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "When this pandemic is over, the world will be split into 2 types of people - For some it'd be a memory of a strenuous time, one marred by death and desperation. For some - it'll only be the faces that remain. The ones they held while gasping, the ones they caressed on the pyre.", "tokens": ["When", "this", "pandemic", "is", "over", ",", "the", "world", "will", "be", "split", "into", "2", "types", "of", "people", "-", "For", "some", "it'd", "be", "a", "memory", "of", "a", "strenuous", "time", ",", "one", "marred", "by", "death", "and", "desperation", ".", "For", "some", "-", "it'll", "only", "be", "the", "faces", "that", "remain", ".", "The", "ones", "they", "held", "while", "gasping", ",", "the", "ones", "they", "caressed", "on", "the", "pyre", "."], "token_idx": 59, "text_start": 273, "text_end": 277, "date": "2021-04"}}
