{"id": "ed6307fb", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "Lrt; LORDT PLS I had to go to the ER last year bc of some unlabeled M&amp;Ms", "tokens": ["Lrt", ";", "LORDT", "PLS", "I", "had", "to", "go", "to", "the", "ER", "last", "year", "bc", "of", "some", "unlabeled", "M", "&", "Ms"], "token_idx": 16, "text_start": 58, "text_end": 67, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "non-binary isn't a \u201cthird gender\u201d but for some reason everybody still treats it as one. stop making unlabeled a label and stop saying that being lesbian, bi, gay, etc doesn't include non-binary people. i'm sick of it /srs", "tokens": ["non-binary", "isn't", "a", "\u201c", "third", "gender", "\u201d", "but", "for", "some", "reason", "everybody", "still", "treats", "it", "as", "one", ".", "stop", "making", "unlabeled", "a", "label", "and", "stop", "saying", "that", "being", "lesbian", ",", "bi", ",", "gay", ",", "etc", "doesn't", "include", "non-binary", "people", ".", "i'm", "sick", "of", "it", "/", "srs"], "token_idx": 20, "text_start": 100, "text_end": 109, "date": "2021-03"}}
{"id": "d03b8a43", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Sean Manaea on 95.7 on his goal to wear a mask while pitching: \"I tried pitching a bullpen with it and it was pretty difficult... so I might have to recant that statement.\"", "tokens": ["Sean", "Manaea", "on", "95.7", "on", "his", "goal", "to", "wear", "a", "mask", "while", "pitching", ":", "\"", "I", "tried", "pitching", "a", "bullpen", "with", "it", "and", "it", "was", "pretty", "difficult", "...", "so", "I", "might", "have", "to", "recant", "that", "statement", ".", "\""], "token_idx": 19, "text_start": 83, "text_end": 90, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "DAMMIT! O's just let Toronto tie it in the 9th. I miss having a reliable bullpen.", "tokens": ["DAMMIT", "!", "O's", "just", "let", "Toronto", "tie", "it", "in", "the", "9th", ".", "I", "miss", "having", "a", "reliable", "bullpen", "."], "token_idx": 17, "text_start": 73, "text_end": 80, "date": "2021-06"}}
