{"id": "28a3c97f", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "As a delta builds out into a shallow marine environment, deposit-feeding creatures begin ingesting and excreting the muddy sediment, and that's when the shit hits the fan.", "tokens": ["As", "a", "delta", "builds", "out", "into", "a", "shallow", "marine", "environment", ",", "deposit-feeding", "creatures", "begin", "ingesting", "and", "excreting", "the", "muddy", "sediment", ",", "and", "that's", "when", "the", "shit", "hits", "the", "fan", "."], "token_idx": 2, "text_start": 5, "text_end": 10, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I read today that the delta variant of COVID is about 60% more transmissable than the alpha, or original, version of the disease. On average, someone with the alpha will give the disease to 2.5 people. With delta? About six.", "tokens": ["I", "read", "today", "that", "the", "delta", "variant", "of", "COVID", "is", "about", "60", "%", "more", "transmissable", "than", "the", "alpha", ",", "or", "original", ",", "version", "of", "the", "disease", ".", "On", "average", ",", "someone", "with", "the", "alpha", "will", "give", "the", "disease", "to", "2.5", "people", ".", "With", "delta", "?", "About", "six", "."], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 22, "text_end": 27, "date": "2021-08"}}
