{"id": "d8b01095", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "when Hozier said \"if I was born as a blackthorn tree, I'd wanna be felled by you, held by you, fuel the pyre of your enemies\" and when Alex Brown Church said \"O Maria, I'd break my wooden bones for you\"", "tokens": ["when", "Hozier", "said", "\"", "if", "I", "was", "born", "as", "a", "blackthorn", "tree", ",", "I'd", "wanna", "be", "felled", "by", "you", ",", "held", "by", "you", ",", "fuel", "the", "pyre", "of", "your", "enemies", "\"", "and", "when", "Alex", "Brown", "Church", "said", "\"", "O", "Maria", ",", "I'd", "break", "my", "wooden", "bones", "for", "you", "\""], "token_idx": 26, "text_start": 104, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It is good that some of us are talking about how developed countries treat their departed. Each death is accounted for, with reasons. Let us also do that rather than pontificate on the sanctity of the pyre.", "tokens": ["It", "is", "good", "that", "some", "of", "us", "are", "talking", "about", "how", "developed", "countries", "treat", "their", "departed", ".", "Each", "death", "is", "accounted", "for", ",", "with", "reasons", ".", "Let", "us", "also", "do", "that", "rather", "than", "pontificate", "on", "the", "sanctity", "of", "the", "pyre", "."], "token_idx": 39, "text_start": 201, "text_end": 205, "date": "2021-04"}}
