{"id": "8bcdafec", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "When i die i don't wanna be buried i wanna be burned on a pyre", "tokens": ["When", "i", "die", "i", "don't", "wanna", "be", "buried", "i", "wanna", "be", "burned", "on", "a", "pyre"], "token_idx": 14, "text_start": 58, "text_end": 62, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It was raining unusually heavy that day, under the makeshift roof the pyre was burning. It was just one among thousands. He stood there drenched, watching the flames dance under the roofs shade, the dark smoke trying hard to escape out, the rain hiding his cries. It was she who", "tokens": ["It", "was", "raining", "unusually", "heavy", "that", "day", ",", "under", "the", "makeshift", "roof", "the", "pyre", "was", "burning", ".", "It", "was", "just", "one", "among", "thousands", ".", "He", "stood", "there", "drenched", ",", "watching", "the", "flames", "dance", "under", "the", "roofs", "shade", ",", "the", "dark", "smoke", "trying", "hard", "to", "escape", "out", ",", "the", "rain", "hiding", "his", "cries", ".", "It", "was", "she", "who"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 70, "text_end": 74, "date": "2021-04"}}
