{"id": "b605781a", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "Today I learned that my copy of An American Tail is a double feature with Fievel Goes West on the unlabeled back side of the disc. I can't remember a single thing about this movie. #QuarantineRewatch", "tokens": ["Today", "I", "learned", "that", "my", "copy", "of", "An", "American", "Tail", "is", "a", "double", "feature", "with", "Fievel", "Goes", "West", "on", "the", "unlabeled", "back", "side", "of", "the", "disc", ".", "I", "can't", "remember", "a", "single", "thing", "about", "this", "movie", ".", "#QuarantineRewatch"], "token_idx": 20, "text_start": 98, "text_end": 107, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "labels 4 me are always so restricting. it always feels like u have to fit in this little mold and i dont like that part of the reason why i decided to use any pronouns cos i got bored of sitting in a box like that. part of the reason i kinda wanna be unlabeled!!!", "tokens": ["labels", "4", "me", "are", "always", "so", "restricting", ".", "it", "always", "feels", "like", "u", "have", "to", "fit", "in", "this", "little", "mold", "and", "i", "dont", "like", "that", "part", "of", "the", "reason", "why", "i", "decided", "to", "use", "any", "pronouns", "cos", "i", "got", "bored", "of", "sitting", "in", "a", "box", "like", "that", ".", "part", "of", "the", "reason", "i", "kinda", "wanna", "be", "unlabeled", "!", "!", "!"], "token_idx": 56, "text_start": 251, "text_end": 260, "date": "2021-03"}}
