{"id": "330a3b86", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Montgomery isn't a fan of the extra innings rule. It's going to speed things up and there's a lot less room for error. Having a strikeout heavy bullpen definitely helps in that scenario.", "tokens": ["Montgomery", "isn't", "a", "fan", "of", "the", "extra", "innings", "rule", ".", "It's", "going", "to", "speed", "things", "up", "and", "there's", "a", "lot", "less", "room", "for", "error", ".", "Having", "a", "strikeout", "heavy", "bullpen", "definitely", "helps", "in", "that", "scenario", "."], "token_idx": 29, "text_start": 144, "text_end": 151, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The Cardinals are 41-44 but it feels worse. The bullpen is a problem just like the last few years. When they get a good effort from the starting pitcher either the bullpen blows it or the offense can't score enough runs. #Stlfly", "tokens": ["The", "Cardinals", "are", "41-44", "but", "it", "feels", "worse", ".", "The", "bullpen", "is", "a", "problem", "just", "like", "the", "last", "few", "years", ".", "When", "they", "get", "a", "good", "effort", "from", "the", "starting", "pitcher", "either", "the", "bullpen", "blows", "it", "or", "the", "offense", "can't", "score", "enough", "runs", ".", "#Stlfly"], "token_idx": 10, "text_start": 48, "text_end": 55, "date": "2021-06"}}
