{"id": "b02de3eb", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "If you trade options Moves like today \ud83d\udcc9 Is why you need short delta \u2614\ufe0f", "tokens": ["If", "you", "trade", "options", "Moves", "like", "today", "\ud83d\udcc9", "Is", "why", "you", "need", "short", "delta", "\u2614", "\ufe0f"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 62, "text_end": 67, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I read today that the delta variant of COVID is about 60% more transmissable than the alpha, or original, version of the disease. On average, someone with the alpha will give the disease to 2.5 people. With delta? About six.", "tokens": ["I", "read", "today", "that", "the", "delta", "variant", "of", "COVID", "is", "about", "60", "%", "more", "transmissable", "than", "the", "alpha", ",", "or", "original", ",", "version", "of", "the", "disease", ".", "On", "average", ",", "someone", "with", "the", "alpha", "will", "give", "the", "disease", "to", "2.5", "people", ".", "With", "delta", "?", "About", "six", "."], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 22, "text_end": 27, "date": "2021-08"}}
