{"id": "0420b4d7", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "As a delta builds out into a shallow marine environment, deposit-feeding creatures begin ingesting and excreting the muddy sediment, and that's when the shit hits the fan.", "tokens": ["As", "a", "delta", "builds", "out", "into", "a", "shallow", "marine", "environment", ",", "deposit-feeding", "creatures", "begin", "ingesting", "and", "excreting", "the", "muddy", "sediment", ",", "and", "that's", "when", "the", "shit", "hits", "the", "fan", "."], "token_idx": 2, "text_start": 5, "text_end": 10, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Consumer sentiment has been and always will be politically partisan, so it's no wonder that the hypochondriacs from the D aisle are making their fear and cowardice known loud and clear. Fade the delta variant narrative", "tokens": ["Consumer", "sentiment", "has", "been", "and", "always", "will", "be", "politically", "partisan", ",", "so", "it's", "no", "wonder", "that", "the", "hypochondriacs", "from", "the", "D", "aisle", "are", "making", "their", "fear", "and", "cowardice", "known", "loud", "and", "clear", ".", "Fade", "the", "delta", "variant", "narrative"], "token_idx": 35, "text_start": 195, "text_end": 200, "date": "2021-08"}}
