{"id": "8e50dee2", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Lost Ones gather dry timber and stack it high on the pyre at the center of the grove. The twins are weaving the crown of flowers that will top the Maypole. It's the Eve of Beltane. For the children this means honey cakes and floral dresses, a bonfire and late night dances.", "tokens": ["Lost", "Ones", "gather", "dry", "timber", "and", "stack", "it", "high", "on", "the", "pyre", "at", "the", "center", "of", "the", "grove", ".", "The", "twins", "are", "weaving", "the", "crown", "of", "flowers", "that", "will", "top", "the", "Maypole", ".", "It's", "the", "Eve", "of", "Beltane", ".", "For", "the", "children", "this", "means", "honey", "cakes", "and", "floral", "dresses", ",", "a", "bonfire", "and", "late", "night", "dances", "."], "token_idx": 11, "text_start": 53, "text_end": 57, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "the overflow from their eyes intractable as they lay her body on the pyre in a quilt of emotion the elder sheds her skin in the twilight releasing her true form ushering the heart on fire into its new plane leaving only the ashes of a dream", "tokens": ["the", "overflow", "from", "their", "eyes", "intractable", "as", "they", "lay", "her", "body", "on", "the", "pyre", "in", "a", "quilt", "of", "emotion", "the", "elder", "sheds", "her", "skin", "in", "the", "twilight", "releasing", "her", "true", "form", "ushering", "the", "heart", "on", "fire", "into", "its", "new", "plane", "leaving", "only", "the", "ashes", "of", "a", "dream"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 69, "text_end": 73, "date": "2021-04"}}
