{"id": "42f5cc19", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Dear Finance Media Overlords: You do realize, don't you, that with each passing day of COVID Groundhog Day fear-mongering, its ability to take down the market decreases? You'd best have a new Doomsday Mistress warming up in the bullpen, because this one is tired &amp; about to go.", "tokens": ["Dear", "Finance", "Media", "Overlords", ":", "You", "do", "realize", ",", "don't", "you", ",", "that", "with", "each", "passing", "day", "of", "COVID", "Groundhog", "Day", "fear-mongering", ",", "its", "ability", "to", "take", "down", "the", "market", "decreases", "?", "You'd", "best", "have", "a", "new", "Doomsday", "Mistress", "warming", "up", "in", "the", "bullpen", ",", "because", "this", "one", "is", "tired", "&", "about", "to", "go", "."], "token_idx": 43, "text_start": 228, "text_end": 235, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The Blue Jays have lost 16 games when tied or leading in the 7th inning or later. This is largely because of the bullpen. If they cut that number in half, they are in 1st in the AL East.", "tokens": ["The", "Blue", "Jays", "have", "lost", "16", "games", "when", "tied", "or", "leading", "in", "the", "7th", "inning", "or", "later", ".", "This", "is", "largely", "because", "of", "the", "bullpen", ".", "If", "they", "cut", "that", "number", "in", "half", ",", "they", "are", "in", "1st", "in", "the", "AL", "East", "."], "token_idx": 24, "text_start": 113, "text_end": 120, "date": "2021-06"}}
