{"id": "c27dd5cb", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "I think the strength of the moral vanguard of a society lies in whether the majority of people laugh at degenerate behaviour, or are disgusted by degen behaviour. If you merely laugh, that's acceptance. If you are disgusted, you actually want to defend moral &amp; social values.", "tokens": ["I", "think", "the", "strength", "of", "the", "moral", "vanguard", "of", "a", "society", "lies", "in", "whether", "the", "majority", "of", "people", "laugh", "at", "degenerate", "behaviour", ",", "or", "are", "disgusted", "by", "degen", "behaviour", ".", "If", "you", "merely", "laugh", ",", "that's", "acceptance", ".", "If", "you", "are", "disgusted", ",", "you", "actually", "want", "to", "defend", "moral", "&", "social", "values", "."], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 34, "text_end": 42, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Imagine if consoles had backwards controller compatibility. Whipping out the Duke for the original Xbox and kicking peoples teeth in on halo infinite or cod vanguard yelling \"what? Did you have to use the controller you got with your Xbox? Got the baby hands?\"", "tokens": ["Imagine", "if", "consoles", "had", "backwards", "controller", "compatibility", ".", "Whipping", "out", "the", "Duke", "for", "the", "original", "Xbox", "and", "kicking", "peoples", "teeth", "in", "on", "halo", "infinite", "or", "cod", "vanguard", "yelling", "\"", "what", "?", "Did", "you", "have", "to", "use", "the", "controller", "you", "got", "with", "your", "Xbox", "?", "Got", "the", "baby", "hands", "?", "\""], "token_idx": 26, "text_start": 157, "text_end": 165, "date": "2021-09"}}
