{"id": "966aeed4", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "\"The emperor has no clothes!\" Rough hands bound the child and carried them to the pyre. Their mouth was gagged to stop the heresies. As the rising flames illuminated the faces of the crowd, all saw what radiant garments clothed the emperor.", "tokens": ["\"", "The", "emperor", "has", "no", "clothes", "!", "\"", "Rough", "hands", "bound", "the", "child", "and", "carried", "them", "to", "the", "pyre", ".", "Their", "mouth", "was", "gagged", "to", "stop", "the", "heresies", ".", "As", "the", "rising", "flames", "illuminated", "the", "faces", "of", "the", "crowd", ",", "all", "saw", "what", "radiant", "garments", "clothed", "the", "emperor", "."], "token_idx": 18, "text_start": 82, "text_end": 86, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It was raining unusually heavy that day, under the makeshift roof the pyre was burning. It was just one among thousands. He stood there drenched, watching the flames dance under the roofs shade, the dark smoke trying hard to escape out, the rain hiding his cries. It was she who", "tokens": ["It", "was", "raining", "unusually", "heavy", "that", "day", ",", "under", "the", "makeshift", "roof", "the", "pyre", "was", "burning", ".", "It", "was", "just", "one", "among", "thousands", ".", "He", "stood", "there", "drenched", ",", "watching", "the", "flames", "dance", "under", "the", "roofs", "shade", ",", "the", "dark", "smoke", "trying", "hard", "to", "escape", "out", ",", "the", "rain", "hiding", "his", "cries", ".", "It", "was", "she", "who"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 70, "text_end": 74, "date": "2021-04"}}
