{"id": "b2ce4e88", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Joe Biden may be running out of gas. The skipper is looking down to the bullpen and calling for the lanky lefty from Vermont. Bernie Sanders. Sanders is generous to a fault in sharing the wealth among opposing batters. Has a 9.80 ERA this year.", "tokens": ["Joe", "Biden", "may", "be", "running", "out", "of", "gas", ".", "The", "skipper", "is", "looking", "down", "to", "the", "bullpen", "and", "calling", "for", "the", "lanky", "lefty", "from", "Vermont", ".", "Bernie", "Sanders", ".", "Sanders", "is", "generous", "to", "a", "fault", "in", "sharing", "the", "wealth", "among", "opposing", "batters", ".", "Has", "a", "9.80", "ERA", "this", "year", "."], "token_idx": 16, "text_start": 72, "text_end": 79, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Angels should consider trading for Paul Fry and/or Tyler Wells if they want to compete this year. Bolster that bullpen with fresh arms. Wells is lowkey sick and Fry's had good numbers so far; both have potential and would definitely help our bullpen.", "tokens": ["Angels", "should", "consider", "trading", "for", "Paul", "Fry", "and", "/", "or", "Tyler", "Wells", "if", "they", "want", "to", "compete", "this", "year", ".", "Bolster", "that", "bullpen", "with", "fresh", "arms", ".", "Wells", "is", "lowkey", "sick", "and", "Fry's", "had", "good", "numbers", "so", "far", ";", "both", "have", "potential", "and", "would", "definitely", "help", "our", "bullpen", "."], "token_idx": 22, "text_start": 111, "text_end": 118, "date": "2021-06"}}
{"id": "e04d62e8", "word": "moxie", "tweet1": {"text": "I've made 7 instructional videos since our campus moved online on March 13. So far, whatever moxie &amp; frisson existed in my live presentations seems replaced by the slow-motion lethargy of gurgling man talking while submerged inside a bathtub.", "tokens": ["I've", "made", "7", "instructional", "videos", "since", "our", "campus", "moved", "online", "on", "March", "13", ".", "So", "far", ",", "whatever", "moxie", "&", "frisson", "existed", "in", "my", "live", "presentations", "seems", "replaced", "by", "the", "slow-motion", "lethargy", "of", "gurgling", "man", "talking", "while", "submerged", "inside", "a", "bathtub", "."], "token_idx": 18, "text_start": 93, "text_end": 98, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "You know who'd be really useful for the rebuilding Magic? A long, defensive wing with some 3pt capability, moxie, and a bit of flair. Oubre (to be resigned to a big deal while the Magic build their long-term core) + Paschall (a new score-first PF for their core!) = Aaron Gordon.", "tokens": ["You", "know", "who'd", "be", "really", "useful", "for", "the", "rebuilding", "Magic", "?", "A", "long", ",", "defensive", "wing", "with", "some", "3pt", "capability", ",", "moxie", ",", "and", "a", "bit", "of", "flair", ".", "Oubre", "(", "to", "be", "resigned", "to", "a", "big", "deal", "while", "the", "Magic", "build", "their", "long-term", "core", ")", "+", "Paschall", "(", "a", "new", "score-first", "PF", "for", "their", "core", "!", ")", "=", "Aaron", "Gordon", "."], "token_idx": 21, "text_start": 107, "text_end": 112, "date": "2021-03"}}
