{"id": "6765c98e", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "it's 2038. a new pandemic has swept the globe, deadlier than the last. my wife has ignited all my electronics in a pyre in the front yard because she read an article that said you can \u201ccontract the virus online\u201d. my love for her grows stronger with each passing day.", "tokens": ["it's", "2038", ".", "a", "new", "pandemic", "has", "swept", "the", "globe", ",", "deadlier", "than", "the", "last", ".", "my", "wife", "has", "ignited", "all", "my", "electronics", "in", "a", "pyre", "in", "the", "front", "yard", "because", "she", "read", "an", "article", "that", "said", "you", "can", "\u201c", "contract", "the", "virus", "online", "\u201d", ".", "my", "love", "for", "her", "grows", "stronger", "with", "each", "passing", "day", "."], "token_idx": 25, "text_start": 115, "text_end": 119, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "When this pandemic is over, the world will be split into 2 types of people - For some it'd be a memory of a strenuous time, one marred by death and desperation. For some - it'll only be the faces that remain. The ones they held while gasping, the ones they caressed on the pyre.", "tokens": ["When", "this", "pandemic", "is", "over", ",", "the", "world", "will", "be", "split", "into", "2", "types", "of", "people", "-", "For", "some", "it'd", "be", "a", "memory", "of", "a", "strenuous", "time", ",", "one", "marred", "by", "death", "and", "desperation", ".", "For", "some", "-", "it'll", "only", "be", "the", "faces", "that", "remain", ".", "The", "ones", "they", "held", "while", "gasping", ",", "the", "ones", "they", "caressed", "on", "the", "pyre", "."], "token_idx": 59, "text_start": 273, "text_end": 277, "date": "2021-04"}}
