{"id": "512440d1", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "when hozier said \"if I was born as a blackthorn tree, i'd wanna be felled by you, held by you, fuel the pyre of your enemies\" and when wwx said \"if i have to die, let it be by your hand, that would be enough\"", "tokens": ["when", "hozier", "said", "\"", "if", "I", "was", "born", "as", "a", "blackthorn", "tree", ",", "i'd", "wanna", "be", "felled", "by", "you", ",", "held", "by", "you", ",", "fuel", "the", "pyre", "of", "your", "enemies", "\"", "and", "when", "wwx", "said", "\"", "if", "i", "have", "to", "die", ",", "let", "it", "be", "by", "your", "hand", ",", "that", "would", "be", "enough", "\""], "token_idx": 26, "text_start": 104, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The dove descending breaks the air With flame of incandescent terror Of which the tongues declare The one dischage from sin and error. The only hope, or else despair Lies in the choice of pyre of pyre - To be redeemed from fire by fire. #HolySpirit #Pentecost #whitsunday", "tokens": ["The", "dove", "descending", "breaks", "the", "air", "With", "flame", "of", "incandescent", "terror", "Of", "which", "the", "tongues", "declare", "The", "one", "dischage", "from", "sin", "and", "error", ".", "The", "only", "hope", ",", "or", "else", "despair", "Lies", "in", "the", "choice", "of", "pyre", "of", "pyre", "-", "To", "be", "redeemed", "from", "fire", "by", "fire", ".", "#HolySpirit", "#Pentecost", "#whitsunday"], "token_idx": 36, "text_start": 188, "text_end": 192, "date": "2021-04"}}
{"id": "860896c1", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "Don't know who else is in the habit of populating their freezer w small leftover dough clumps left unlabeled, but the strategy sure as hell doesn't pay off when you actually need to make something with them. (Worse, I've started freezing random bread ends, an atavistic neurosis)", "tokens": ["Don't", "know", "who", "else", "is", "in", "the", "habit", "of", "populating", "their", "freezer", "w", "small", "leftover", "dough", "clumps", "left", "unlabeled", ",", "but", "the", "strategy", "sure", "as", "hell", "doesn't", "pay", "off", "when", "you", "actually", "need", "to", "make", "something", "with", "them", ".", "(", "Worse", ",", "I've", "started", "freezing", "random", "bread", "ends", ",", "an", "atavistic", "neurosis", ")"], "token_idx": 18, "text_start": 99, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "\"Why did you let him go?\" Two things. It felt unfair to keep a person in an unlabeled relationship. He deserves better and I'm not the one who can provide that. I realized how foolish I was, trying to pursue the love that I thought I had found...+", "tokens": ["\"", "Why", "did", "you", "let", "him", "go", "?", "\"", "Two", "things", ".", "It", "felt", "unfair", "to", "keep", "a", "person", "in", "an", "unlabeled", "relationship", ".", "He", "deserves", "better", "and", "I'm", "not", "the", "one", "who", "can", "provide", "that", ".", "I", "realized", "how", "foolish", "I", "was", ",", "trying", "to", "pursue", "the", "love", "that", "I", "thought", "I", "had", "found", "...", "+"], "token_idx": 21, "text_start": 76, "text_end": 85, "date": "2021-03"}}
