{"id": "91e4e46a", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Joe Biden may be running out of gas. The skipper is looking down to the bullpen and calling for the lanky lefty from Vermont. Bernie Sanders. Sanders is generous to a fault in sharing the wealth among opposing batters. Has a 9.80 ERA this year.", "tokens": ["Joe", "Biden", "may", "be", "running", "out", "of", "gas", ".", "The", "skipper", "is", "looking", "down", "to", "the", "bullpen", "and", "calling", "for", "the", "lanky", "lefty", "from", "Vermont", ".", "Bernie", "Sanders", ".", "Sanders", "is", "generous", "to", "a", "fault", "in", "sharing", "the", "wealth", "among", "opposing", "batters", ".", "Has", "a", "9.80", "ERA", "this", "year", "."], "token_idx": 16, "text_start": 72, "text_end": 79, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Definitely did not see this version of Liam Hendriks coming when he was giving up moonshots as a #BlueJays starter in 2014. It was a bit more obvious a year later when he was sent to the bullpen, but didn't think it would last. At least not like this. What an arm.", "tokens": ["Definitely", "did", "not", "see", "this", "version", "of", "Liam", "Hendriks", "coming", "when", "he", "was", "giving", "up", "moonshots", "as", "a", "#BlueJays", "starter", "in", "2014", ".", "It", "was", "a", "bit", "more", "obvious", "a", "year", "later", "when", "he", "was", "sent", "to", "the", "bullpen", ",", "but", "didn't", "think", "it", "would", "last", ".", "At", "least", "not", "like", "this", ".", "What", "an", "arm", "."], "token_idx": 38, "text_start": 187, "text_end": 194, "date": "2021-06"}}
