{"id": "05ee69f0", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "it's 2038. a new pandemic has swept the globe, deadlier than the last. my wife has ignited all my electronics in a pyre in the front yard because she read an article that said you can \u201ccontract the virus online\u201d. my love for her grows stronger with each passing day.", "tokens": ["it's", "2038", ".", "a", "new", "pandemic", "has", "swept", "the", "globe", ",", "deadlier", "than", "the", "last", ".", "my", "wife", "has", "ignited", "all", "my", "electronics", "in", "a", "pyre", "in", "the", "front", "yard", "because", "she", "read", "an", "article", "that", "said", "you", "can", "\u201c", "contract", "the", "virus", "online", "\u201d", ".", "my", "love", "for", "her", "grows", "stronger", "with", "each", "passing", "day", "."], "token_idx": 25, "text_start": 115, "text_end": 119, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "He arrives on the planet to awestruck stares. Anything he asks for, he is given: Food, riches, women, a grand palace. Hanging up his astronaut helmet, he becomes their idle #idol, drunk, rotund and dumb. In his stupor, he does not notice his throne is actually a pyre. #vss365", "tokens": ["He", "arrives", "on", "the", "planet", "to", "awestruck", "stares", ".", "Anything", "he", "asks", "for", ",", "he", "is", "given", ":", "Food", ",", "riches", ",", "women", ",", "a", "grand", "palace", ".", "Hanging", "up", "his", "astronaut", "helmet", ",", "he", "becomes", "their", "idle", "#idol", ",", "drunk", ",", "rotund", "and", "dumb", ".", "In", "his", "stupor", ",", "he", "does", "not", "notice", "his", "throne", "is", "actually", "a", "pyre", ".", "#vss365"], "token_idx": 59, "text_start": 263, "text_end": 267, "date": "2021-04"}}
