{"id": "119279d8", "word": "gaza", "tweet1": {"text": "Buss my gun pon cane field gaza and people hear it in green field", "tokens": ["Buss", "my", "gun", "pon", "cane", "field", "gaza", "and", "people", "hear", "it", "in", "green", "field"], "token_idx": 6, "text_start": 27, "text_end": 31, "date": "2020-05"}, "tweet2": {"text": "we finally got to gaza a few hours ago. we're in my grandparents' house (\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647 \u064a\u0631\u062d\u0645\u0647\u0645) and we're looking through their picture albums that have been untouched for 15 years. next week, we go to my second home in al-quds, i can't wait to pray at al-aqsa. #\u063a\u0631\u062f_\u0643\u0623\u0646\u0647\u0627_\u062d\u0631\u0629", "tokens": ["we", "finally", "got", "to", "gaza", "a", "few", "hours", "ago", ".", "we're", "in", "my", "grandparents", "'", "house", "(", "\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647", "\u064a\u0631\u062d\u0645\u0647\u0645", ")", "and", "we're", "looking", "through", "their", "picture", "albums", "that", "have", "been", "untouched", "for", "15", "years", ".", "next", "week", ",", "we", "go", "to", "my", "second", "home", "in", "al-quds", ",", "i", "can't", "wait", "to", "pray", "at", "al-aqsa", ".", "#\u063a\u0631\u062f_\u0643\u0623\u0646\u0647\u0627_\u062d\u0631\u0629"], "token_idx": 4, "text_start": 18, "text_end": 22, "date": "2021-05"}}
