{"id": "c5c25b27", "word": "gala", "tweet1": {"text": "#LavanyaTripathi has seen one pic of #SundeepKishan in the six pack and commented it saying she has had the most fun in the shoot of this challenging film. Looks like they had a gala time and friendship moments on the sets", "tokens": ["#LavanyaTripathi", "has", "seen", "one", "pic", "of", "#SundeepKishan", "in", "the", "six", "pack", "and", "commented", "it", "saying", "she", "has", "had", "the", "most", "fun", "in", "the", "shoot", "of", "this", "challenging", "film", ".", "Looks", "like", "they", "had", "a", "gala", "time", "and", "friendship", "moments", "on", "the", "sets"], "token_idx": 34, "text_start": 178, "text_end": 182, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Had a dream where I was participating in a mock US Senate procedure at Capitol. Afterward, how we voted vs who we matched with was shown. My voting pattern was consistent with @AOC for which she cheered me. She was in white gala dress. We hugged and got invited as her assistant.", "tokens": ["Had", "a", "dream", "where", "I", "was", "participating", "in", "a", "mock", "US", "Senate", "procedure", "at", "Capitol", ".", "Afterward", ",", "how", "we", "voted", "vs", "who", "we", "matched", "with", "was", "shown", ".", "My", "voting", "pattern", "was", "consistent", "with", "@AOC", "for", "which", "she", "cheered", "me", ".", "She", "was", "in", "white", "gala", "dress", ".", "We", "hugged", "and", "got", "invited", "as", "her", "assistant", "."], "token_idx": 46, "text_start": 224, "text_end": 228, "date": "2021-09"}}
