{"id": "3be0256b", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "Soooo I got in a bunch of plants from Josh's Frogs for some bioactive enclosures, as well as the clean up crew, and there's also a mysterious, unlabeled bag of yellow liquid, that's neither cold nor warm. Is this a cold pack? Or a heat pack? Or some weird fertilizer? Help lol", "tokens": ["Soooo", "I", "got", "in", "a", "bunch", "of", "plants", "from", "Josh's", "Frogs", "for", "some", "bioactive", "enclosures", ",", "as", "well", "as", "the", "clean", "up", "crew", ",", "and", "there's", "also", "a", "mysterious", ",", "unlabeled", "bag", "of", "yellow", "liquid", ",", "that's", "neither", "cold", "nor", "warm", ".", "Is", "this", "a", "cold", "pack", "?", "Or", "a", "heat", "pack", "?", "Or", "some", "weird", "fertilizer", "?", "Help", "lol"], "token_idx": 30, "text_start": 143, "text_end": 152, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Heyo :\u201d)!! I'm Rabies / Rae i'm a unlabeled lgbt+ cc who has been playing minecraft since the game was released i'm semi okay at pvp but I still want to give it my best shot and im pretty good with a bow :0? Maybe just maybe you could consider me! (@LGBTUHC #LGBTUHC)", "tokens": ["Heyo", ":", "\u201d", ")", "!", "!", "I'm", "Rabies", "/", "Rae", "i'm", "a", "unlabeled", "lgbt", "+", "cc", "who", "has", "been", "playing", "minecraft", "since", "the", "game", "was", "released", "i'm", "semi", "okay", "at", "pvp", "but", "I", "still", "want", "to", "give", "it", "my", "best", "shot", "and", "im", "pretty", "good", "with", "a", "bow", ":", "0", "?", "Maybe", "just", "maybe", "you", "could", "consider", "me", "!", "(", "@LGBTUHC", "#LGBTUHC", ")"], "token_idx": 12, "text_start": 34, "text_end": 43, "date": "2021-03"}}
