{"id": "b92cfb05", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "May we not focus on the irrelevant standards set by society. Because at the end of the day no matter how perfect you are they will still throw shades at you my dear. Always remember \u201cwe are all humans we deserve to be unlabeled\u201d. Don't limit your happiness\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe", "tokens": ["May", "we", "not", "focus", "on", "the", "irrelevant", "standards", "set", "by", "society", ".", "Because", "at", "the", "end", "of", "the", "day", "no", "matter", "how", "perfect", "you", "are", "they", "will", "still", "throw", "shades", "at", "you", "my", "dear", ".", "Always", "remember", "\u201c", "we", "are", "all", "humans", "we", "deserve", "to", "be", "unlabeled", "\u201d", ".", "Don't", "limit", "your", "happiness", "\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe", "\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe", "\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe"], "token_idx": 46, "text_start": 218, "text_end": 227, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "My boyfriend buys wagyu steaks to make broccoli stir fry... and wagyu ground pork to make spaghetti... I'm LOSING it over his bougieness. Sir I use the unlabeled meat in ziplock bags found in my freezer. this is what you'll get", "tokens": ["My", "boyfriend", "buys", "wagyu", "steaks", "to", "make", "broccoli", "stir", "fry", "...", "and", "wagyu", "ground", "pork", "to", "make", "spaghetti", "...", "I'm", "LOSING", "it", "over", "his", "bougieness", ".", "Sir", "I", "use", "the", "unlabeled", "meat", "in", "ziplock", "bags", "found", "in", "my", "freezer", ".", "this", "is", "what", "you'll", "get"], "token_idx": 30, "text_start": 152, "text_end": 161, "date": "2021-03"}}
{"id": "f92c7ef6", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "2019: the one year since 2011 when the bullpen actually worked out \ud83e\udd7a", "tokens": ["2019", ":", "the", "one", "year", "since", "2011", "when", "the", "bullpen", "actually", "worked", "out", "\ud83e\udd7a"], "token_idx": 9, "text_start": 39, "text_end": 46, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Jake Gatewood drills a 2 run HR into the LF bullpen to pull the Bees to within one of OKC at 3-2. It was Gatewood's 14th HR of the season, second on the team behind Jo Adell with 17. All five runs have been driven in with two out hits.", "tokens": ["Jake", "Gatewood", "drills", "a", "2", "run", "HR", "into", "the", "LF", "bullpen", "to", "pull", "the", "Bees", "to", "within", "one", "of", "OKC", "at", "3-2", ".", "It", "was", "Gatewood's", "14th", "HR", "of", "the", "season", ",", "second", "on", "the", "team", "behind", "Jo", "Adell", "with", "17", ".", "All", "five", "runs", "have", "been", "driven", "in", "with", "two", "out", "hits", "."], "token_idx": 10, "text_start": 44, "text_end": 51, "date": "2021-06"}}
