{"id": "0b57f872", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Some people choose to see the ugliness in this world. I choose to see the beauty. Value those precious moments of empathy, remember the meaning of life. Even as the world burns to cinders like a pyre, be a beacon of hope, a guide in the dark, a lighthouse. I believe in you. \ud83d\udd25", "tokens": ["Some", "people", "choose", "to", "see", "the", "ugliness", "in", "this", "world", ".", "I", "choose", "to", "see", "the", "beauty", ".", "Value", "those", "precious", "moments", "of", "empathy", ",", "remember", "the", "meaning", "of", "life", ".", "Even", "as", "the", "world", "burns", "to", "cinders", "like", "a", "pyre", ",", "be", "a", "beacon", "of", "hope", ",", "a", "guide", "in", "the", "dark", ",", "a", "lighthouse", ".", "I", "believe", "in", "you", ".", "\ud83d\udd25"], "token_idx": 40, "text_start": 195, "text_end": 199, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "When I die I want y'all to place me on top of a funeral pyre out on the water and throw flaming arrows at me while I float away, so y'all can watch as I burn and sink :) I wanna go out in a blaze of glory! lol", "tokens": ["When", "I", "die", "I", "want", "y'all", "to", "place", "me", "on", "top", "of", "a", "funeral", "pyre", "out", "on", "the", "water", "and", "throw", "flaming", "arrows", "at", "me", "while", "I", "float", "away", ",", "so", "y'all", "can", "watch", "as", "I", "burn", "and", "sink", ":)", "I", "wanna", "go", "out", "in", "a", "blaze", "of", "glory", "!", "lol"], "token_idx": 14, "text_start": 56, "text_end": 60, "date": "2021-04"}}
