{"id": "8c7a3c96", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Been pretty neat re-living the 2008 @Phillies postseason run to a World Series championship on @NBCSPhilly these past three weeks. Also neat seeing them take on young Clayton Kershaw and David Price along the way, both being used out of the bullpen as relievers.", "tokens": ["Been", "pretty", "neat", "re-living", "the", "2008", "@Phillies", "postseason", "run", "to", "a", "World", "Series", "championship", "on", "@NBCSPhilly", "these", "past", "three", "weeks", ".", "Also", "neat", "seeing", "them", "take", "on", "young", "Clayton", "Kershaw", "and", "David", "Price", "along", "the", "way", ",", "both", "being", "used", "out", "of", "the", "bullpen", "as", "relievers", "."], "token_idx": 43, "text_start": 241, "text_end": 248, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The Blue Jays have lost 16 games when tied or leading in the 7th inning or later. This is largely because of the bullpen. If they cut that number in half, they are in 1st in the AL East.", "tokens": ["The", "Blue", "Jays", "have", "lost", "16", "games", "when", "tied", "or", "leading", "in", "the", "7th", "inning", "or", "later", ".", "This", "is", "largely", "because", "of", "the", "bullpen", ".", "If", "they", "cut", "that", "number", "in", "half", ",", "they", "are", "in", "1st", "in", "the", "AL", "East", "."], "token_idx": 24, "text_start": 113, "text_end": 120, "date": "2021-06"}}
