{"id": "eb71335f", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Martinez on assessing #Nationals 5th starter: \"I want to see who's going to be ready, and who's more apt to actually be able to pitch out of the bullpen if we need them because we're definitely going to need a long man.\" Fedde pitched today in game, Voth in \"next day or so.\"", "tokens": ["Martinez", "on", "assessing", "#Nationals", "5th", "starter", ":", "\"", "I", "want", "to", "see", "who's", "going", "to", "be", "ready", ",", "and", "who's", "more", "apt", "to", "actually", "be", "able", "to", "pitch", "out", "of", "the", "bullpen", "if", "we", "need", "them", "because", "we're", "definitely", "going", "to", "need", "a", "long", "man", ".", "\"", "Fedde", "pitched", "today", "in", "game", ",", "Voth", "in", "\"", "next", "day", "or", "so", ".", "\""], "token_idx": 31, "text_start": 145, "text_end": 152, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The Phillies can have an offense that can score 12 runs a game, but you'll never succeed until you figure out that the bullpen is filled with incompetent boobs. It has been for multiple years.", "tokens": ["The", "Phillies", "can", "have", "an", "offense", "that", "can", "score", "12", "runs", "a", "game", ",", "but", "you'll", "never", "succeed", "until", "you", "figure", "out", "that", "the", "bullpen", "is", "filled", "with", "incompetent", "boobs", ".", "It", "has", "been", "for", "multiple", "years", "."], "token_idx": 24, "text_start": 119, "text_end": 126, "date": "2021-06"}}
