{"id": "ebcda374", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "A Queens Affair: how two bloviating douchebags mishandled a crisis, turning their hometown borough into a funeral pyre. Who plays whom in the play?", "tokens": ["A", "Queens", "Affair", ":", "how", "two", "bloviating", "douchebags", "mishandled", "a", "crisis", ",", "turning", "their", "hometown", "borough", "into", "a", "funeral", "pyre", ".", "Who", "plays", "whom", "in", "the", "play", "?"], "token_idx": 19, "text_start": 114, "text_end": 118, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Respect our dead? Yeah we respect our dead enough to want justice for them. For them to be counted in gross mismanagement of this pandemic. Each pyre and coffin is not a stat, each of them were people, people who deserved a chance to survive, whose families deserved more.", "tokens": ["Respect", "our", "dead", "?", "Yeah", "we", "respect", "our", "dead", "enough", "to", "want", "justice", "for", "them", ".", "For", "them", "to", "be", "counted", "in", "gross", "mismanagement", "of", "this", "pandemic", ".", "Each", "pyre", "and", "coffin", "is", "not", "a", "stat", ",", "each", "of", "them", "were", "people", ",", "people", "who", "deserved", "a", "chance", "to", "survive", ",", "whose", "families", "deserved", "more", "."], "token_idx": 29, "text_start": 145, "text_end": 149, "date": "2021-04"}}
