{"id": "d37a41e5", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "\"Privacy is nothing like a religion in the EU!\" their banners read, as they strap @duncanrobinson to the pyre in central Brussels, ready to be lit, condemned as he is for the crime of blasphemy, by claiming that privacy is like a religion in the EU.", "tokens": ["\"", "Privacy", "is", "nothing", "like", "a", "religion", "in", "the", "EU", "!", "\"", "their", "banners", "read", ",", "as", "they", "strap", "@duncanrobinson", "to", "the", "pyre", "in", "central", "Brussels", ",", "ready", "to", "be", "lit", ",", "condemned", "as", "he", "is", "for", "the", "crime", "of", "blasphemy", ",", "by", "claiming", "that", "privacy", "is", "like", "a", "religion", "in", "the", "EU", "."], "token_idx": 22, "text_start": 105, "text_end": 109, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "On an average from the gazipur cremator's crematorium, where the first 15 pyre were burnt, now there are 120. In some places it is manifold. The official figure is more than 2 lakhs. If we calculate, it will be about 20 lakhs. @Teensthack", "tokens": ["On", "an", "average", "from", "the", "gazipur", "cremator's", "crematorium", ",", "where", "the", "first", "15", "pyre", "were", "burnt", ",", "now", "there", "are", "120", ".", "In", "some", "places", "it", "is", "manifold", ".", "The", "official", "figure", "is", "more", "than", "2", "lakhs", ".", "If", "we", "calculate", ",", "it", "will", "be", "about", "20", "lakhs", ".", "@Teensthack"], "token_idx": 13, "text_start": 74, "text_end": 78, "date": "2021-04"}}
