{"id": "b51c3c5e", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Bryan Abreu out of the bullpen. Brent Strom LOOOOOVES Abreu. Someone to watch out for this season. #astros #mlb #SummerCamp", "tokens": ["Bryan", "Abreu", "out", "of", "the", "bullpen", ".", "Brent", "Strom", "LOOOOOVES", "Abreu", ".", "Someone", "to", "watch", "out", "for", "this", "season", ".", "#astros", "#mlb", "#SummerCamp"], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 23, "text_end": 30, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "The Phillies can have an offense that can score 12 runs a game, but you'll never succeed until you figure out that the bullpen is filled with incompetent boobs. It has been for multiple years.", "tokens": ["The", "Phillies", "can", "have", "an", "offense", "that", "can", "score", "12", "runs", "a", "game", ",", "but", "you'll", "never", "succeed", "until", "you", "figure", "out", "that", "the", "bullpen", "is", "filled", "with", "incompetent", "boobs", ".", "It", "has", "been", "for", "multiple", "years", "."], "token_idx": 24, "text_start": 119, "text_end": 126, "date": "2021-06"}}
