{"id": "97eec2ed", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "One thing I miss about the delta is the ability to have a friend or familiar face in every business.", "tokens": ["One", "thing", "I", "miss", "about", "the", "delta", "is", "the", "ability", "to", "have", "a", "friend", "or", "familiar", "face", "in", "every", "business", "."], "token_idx": 6, "text_start": 27, "text_end": 32, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "How's everyone doing? I've been reading so many people hurting on twitmo. Losing loved ones. Scared for their kids going back to school. Testing positive for covid. This current delta wave feels scarier than the previous one. Please hang in there. Mask up. Get vaxed.", "tokens": ["How's", "everyone", "doing", "?", "I've", "been", "reading", "so", "many", "people", "hurting", "on", "twitmo", ".", "Losing", "loved", "ones", ".", "Scared", "for", "their", "kids", "going", "back", "to", "school", ".", "Testing", "positive", "for", "covid", ".", "This", "current", "delta", "wave", "feels", "scarier", "than", "the", "previous", "one", ".", "Please", "hang", "in", "there", ".", "Mask", "up", ".", "Get", "vaxed", "."], "token_idx": 34, "text_start": 178, "text_end": 183, "date": "2021-08"}}
