{"id": "1ec05d0f", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Y'all a maga boomer retweeted my angst about unemployment and I want to mcfuckin die. Just to set the record straight: I'm a raging lesbian socialist who wants nothing more then to set capitalism ablaze with trump on top of the pyre. You don't get to come here", "tokens": ["Y'all", "a", "maga", "boomer", "retweeted", "my", "angst", "about", "unemployment", "and", "I", "want", "to", "mcfuckin", "die", ".", "Just", "to", "set", "the", "record", "straight", ":", "I'm", "a", "raging", "lesbian", "socialist", "who", "wants", "nothing", "more", "then", "to", "set", "capitalism", "ablaze", "with", "trump", "on", "top", "of", "the", "pyre", ".", "You", "don't", "get", "to", "come", "here"], "token_idx": 43, "text_start": 228, "text_end": 232, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Birth anniversary of Raja #RamMohanRoy. * Crusaded against sati, a Hindu practice of widow getting burnt in the pyre with the husband's body. * Fought against the social practices of polygamy, child marriage, and the caste system. * Fought for property rights for women. #May22", "tokens": ["Birth", "anniversary", "of", "Raja", "#RamMohanRoy", ".", "*", "Crusaded", "against", "sati", ",", "a", "Hindu", "practice", "of", "widow", "getting", "burnt", "in", "the", "pyre", "with", "the", "husband's", "body", ".", "*", "Fought", "against", "the", "social", "practices", "of", "polygamy", ",", "child", "marriage", ",", "and", "the", "caste", "system", ".", "*", "Fought", "for", "property", "rights", "for", "women", ".", "#May22"], "token_idx": 20, "text_start": 112, "text_end": 116, "date": "2021-04"}}
