{"id": "3d18905d", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "One minute, we are labelled the vanguard for western imperialism and American exceptionalism, and the next, we're being reprimanded for not proudly declaring ourselves as \u201cAfrican\u201d, and not seeking solidarity with the diaspora. \ud83d\udc40 Just admit that you hate us and be done with it.", "tokens": ["One", "minute", ",", "we", "are", "labelled", "the", "vanguard", "for", "western", "imperialism", "and", "American", "exceptionalism", ",", "and", "the", "next", ",", "we're", "being", "reprimanded", "for", "not", "proudly", "declaring", "ourselves", "as", "\u201c", "African", "\u201d", ",", "and", "not", "seeking", "solidarity", "with", "the", "diaspora", ".", "\ud83d\udc40", "Just", "admit", "that", "you", "hate", "us", "and", "be", "done", "with", "it", "."], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 32, "text_end": 40, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "According to Caleb, there are three conditions required for a revolution: 1) a massive crisis affecting all levels of society, 2) broad popular unrest against the government, and 3) a revolutionary vanguard organization to direct the energies of the masses. Where are we now?", "tokens": ["According", "to", "Caleb", ",", "there", "are", "three", "conditions", "required", "for", "a", "revolution", ":", "1", ")", "a", "massive", "crisis", "affecting", "all", "levels", "of", "society", ",", "2", ")", "broad", "popular", "unrest", "against", "the", "government", ",", "and", "3", ")", "a", "revolutionary", "vanguard", "organization", "to", "direct", "the", "energies", "of", "the", "masses", ".", "Where", "are", "we", "now", "?"], "token_idx": 38, "text_start": 198, "text_end": 206, "date": "2021-09"}}
