{"id": "898faecf", "word": "delta", "tweet1": {"text": "I feel like od white trash cause I really just had an argument with a Karen in delta Sonics parking lot and now I'm like ok well should've went all out and beat her ass too\ud83d\ude0a", "tokens": ["I", "feel", "like", "od", "white", "trash", "cause", "I", "really", "just", "had", "an", "argument", "with", "a", "Karen", "in", "delta", "Sonics", "parking", "lot", "and", "now", "I'm", "like", "ok", "well", "should've", "went", "all", "out", "and", "beat", "her", "ass", "too", "\ud83d\ude0a"], "token_idx": 17, "text_start": 79, "text_end": 84, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I could not care less about the delta variant it's time to make your own health choices. If you want to get a vaccine and quarantine and wear a mask and take multivitamins out of precaution then go ahead. I'll decide what's best for me though", "tokens": ["I", "could", "not", "care", "less", "about", "the", "delta", "variant", "it's", "time", "to", "make", "your", "own", "health", "choices", ".", "If", "you", "want", "to", "get", "a", "vaccine", "and", "quarantine", "and", "wear", "a", "mask", "and", "take", "multivitamins", "out", "of", "precaution", "then", "go", "ahead", ".", "I'll", "decide", "what's", "best", "for", "me", "though"], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 32, "text_end": 37, "date": "2021-08"}}
