{"id": "733cba77", "word": "unlabeled", "tweet1": {"text": "I have raided my fridge once more to combine the succulent taste of ground beef with the tantalizing sweetness of some unlabeled hot sauce I also found. Bone Apple Tea \ud83d\udc4c\ud83d\ude24", "tokens": ["I", "have", "raided", "my", "fridge", "once", "more", "to", "combine", "the", "succulent", "taste", "of", "ground", "beef", "with", "the", "tantalizing", "sweetness", "of", "some", "unlabeled", "hot", "sauce", "I", "also", "found", ".", "Bone", "Apple", "Tea", "\ud83d\udc4c", "\ud83d\ude24"], "token_idx": 21, "text_start": 119, "text_end": 128, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "due to personal reasons, i'm removing all labels and going unlabeled. the only label staying is my quoiromanic. i've been dealing with a lot so i'm just going that way", "tokens": ["due", "to", "personal", "reasons", ",", "i'm", "removing", "all", "labels", "and", "going", "unlabeled", ".", "the", "only", "label", "staying", "is", "my", "quoiromanic", ".", "i've", "been", "dealing", "with", "a", "lot", "so", "i'm", "just", "going", "that", "way"], "token_idx": 11, "text_start": 59, "text_end": 68, "date": "2021-03"}}
