{"id": "6f74a67f", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "Once again, Oregon voters have a chance to burnish their drug reform credentials, only this time with the most dramatic attack yet on drug prohibition. If they approve Measure 110, they will truly be the drug reform vanguard\u2014and blaze a path voters and legislators elsewhere..", "tokens": ["Once", "again", ",", "Oregon", "voters", "have", "a", "chance", "to", "burnish", "their", "drug", "reform", "credentials", ",", "only", "this", "time", "with", "the", "most", "dramatic", "attack", "yet", "on", "drug", "prohibition", ".", "If", "they", "approve", "Measure", "110", ",", "they", "will", "truly", "be", "the", "drug", "reform", "vanguard", "\u2014", "and", "blaze", "a", "path", "voters", "and", "legislators", "elsewhere", ".."], "token_idx": 41, "text_start": 216, "text_end": 224, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Imagine if consoles had backwards controller compatibility. Whipping out the Duke for the original Xbox and kicking peoples teeth in on halo infinite or cod vanguard yelling \"what? Did you have to use the controller you got with your Xbox? Got the baby hands?\"", "tokens": ["Imagine", "if", "consoles", "had", "backwards", "controller", "compatibility", ".", "Whipping", "out", "the", "Duke", "for", "the", "original", "Xbox", "and", "kicking", "peoples", "teeth", "in", "on", "halo", "infinite", "or", "cod", "vanguard", "yelling", "\"", "what", "?", "Did", "you", "have", "to", "use", "the", "controller", "you", "got", "with", "your", "Xbox", "?", "Got", "the", "baby", "hands", "?", "\""], "token_idx": 26, "text_start": 157, "text_end": 165, "date": "2021-09"}}
