{"id": "0bda582f", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Ump pyre and, fortiffed by @jessebwatters on the condrition of my words we've lived and how to bump where Furphy he is do", "tokens": ["Ump", "pyre", "and", ",", "fortiffed", "by", "@jessebwatters", "on", "the", "condrition", "of", "my", "words", "we've", "lived", "and", "how", "to", "bump", "where", "Furphy", "he", "is", "do"], "token_idx": 1, "text_start": 4, "text_end": 8, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "A friend shared a horrifying experience of cremating his uncle - 'Saumya, we used broken chairs, old doors, anything we could get our hands on to build the pyre, after waiting for 3 hours in a crematorium functioning at twice its capacity.' :(", "tokens": ["A", "friend", "shared", "a", "horrifying", "experience", "of", "cremating", "his", "uncle", "-", "'", "Saumya", ",", "we", "used", "broken", "chairs", ",", "old", "doors", ",", "anything", "we", "could", "get", "our", "hands", "on", "to", "build", "the", "pyre", ",", "after", "waiting", "for", "3", "hours", "in", "a", "crematorium", "functioning", "at", "twice", "its", "capacity", ".", "'", ":("], "token_idx": 32, "text_start": 156, "text_end": 160, "date": "2021-04"}}
