{"id": "ffe6244d", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "One minute, we are labelled the vanguard for western imperialism and American exceptionalism, and the next, we're being reprimanded for not proudly declaring ourselves as \u201cAfrican\u201d, and not seeking solidarity with the diaspora. \ud83d\udc40 Just admit that you hate us and be done with it.", "tokens": ["One", "minute", ",", "we", "are", "labelled", "the", "vanguard", "for", "western", "imperialism", "and", "American", "exceptionalism", ",", "and", "the", "next", ",", "we're", "being", "reprimanded", "for", "not", "proudly", "declaring", "ourselves", "as", "\u201c", "African", "\u201d", ",", "and", "not", "seeking", "solidarity", "with", "the", "diaspora", ".", "\ud83d\udc40", "Just", "admit", "that", "you", "hate", "us", "and", "be", "done", "with", "it", "."], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 32, "text_end": 40, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "So blackrock and vanguard and Gates are buying up all this property. So what happens when they all fall. Who gets it all?", "tokens": ["So", "blackrock", "and", "vanguard", "and", "Gates", "are", "buying", "up", "all", "this", "property", ".", "So", "what", "happens", "when", "they", "all", "fall", ".", "Who", "gets", "it", "all", "?"], "token_idx": 3, "text_start": 17, "text_end": 25, "date": "2021-09"}}
