{"id": "a257805f", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "when hozier said \"if I was born as a blackthorn tree, i'd wanna be felled by you, held by you, fuel the pyre of your enemies\" and when wwx said \"if i have to die, let it be by your hand, that would be enough\"", "tokens": ["when", "hozier", "said", "\"", "if", "I", "was", "born", "as", "a", "blackthorn", "tree", ",", "i'd", "wanna", "be", "felled", "by", "you", ",", "held", "by", "you", ",", "fuel", "the", "pyre", "of", "your", "enemies", "\"", "and", "when", "wwx", "said", "\"", "if", "i", "have", "to", "die", ",", "let", "it", "be", "by", "your", "hand", ",", "that", "would", "be", "enough", "\""], "token_idx": 26, "text_start": 104, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "While Modi was addressing rallies after rallies,ppl were running from hospital to hospital,while Modi was mocking didi,PPL were pleading for oxygen, while Modi was overwhelmed at huge crowd, PPL were shocked at seeing pyre of dead. All for 76 seats.", "tokens": ["While", "Modi", "was", "addressing", "rallies", "after", "rallies", ",", "ppl", "were", "running", "from", "hospital", "to", "hospital", ",", "while", "Modi", "was", "mocking", "didi", ",", "PPL", "were", "pleading", "for", "oxygen", ",", "while", "Modi", "was", "overwhelmed", "at", "huge", "crowd", ",", "PPL", "were", "shocked", "at", "seeing", "pyre", "of", "dead", ".", "All", "for", "76", "seats", "."], "token_idx": 41, "text_start": 218, "text_end": 222, "date": "2021-04"}}
