{"id": "85a3c2b2", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "On. Sennet. As one lived in between his Posthorn in the Ump pyre and, as they are two claps on the most highly from under", "tokens": ["On", ".", "Sennet", ".", "As", "one", "lived", "in", "between", "his", "Posthorn", "in", "the", "Ump", "pyre", "and", ",", "as", "they", "are", "two", "claps", "on", "the", "most", "highly", "from", "under"], "token_idx": 14, "text_start": 60, "text_end": 64, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "#Story of a funeral pyre, burning flames cremate the dead, emancipating the soul from the mortal real. The blinding glare of the flames covers up the reasons for their demise. The flame of the pyre attracts the dissembler like a moth to a candle. So begins the tug of war.", "tokens": ["#Story", "of", "a", "funeral", "pyre", ",", "burning", "flames", "cremate", "the", "dead", ",", "emancipating", "the", "soul", "from", "the", "mortal", "real", ".", "The", "blinding", "glare", "of", "the", "flames", "covers", "up", "the", "reasons", "for", "their", "demise", ".", "The", "flame", "of", "the", "pyre", "attracts", "the", "dissembler", "like", "a", "moth", "to", "a", "candle", ".", "So", "begins", "the", "tug", "of", "war", "."], "token_idx": 4, "text_start": 20, "text_end": 24, "date": "2021-04"}}
