{"id": "8794d342", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "I might be overreacting but it seems like all these home run highlights are off our back end of the bullpen. Hopefully it's just the hitters being ahead. I'm sure they are leaving a few meatballs here or there on purpose as well.", "tokens": ["I", "might", "be", "overreacting", "but", "it", "seems", "like", "all", "these", "home", "run", "highlights", "are", "off", "our", "back", "end", "of", "the", "bullpen", ".", "Hopefully", "it's", "just", "the", "hitters", "being", "ahead", ".", "I'm", "sure", "they", "are", "leaving", "a", "few", "meatballs", "here", "or", "there", "on", "purpose", "as", "well", "."], "token_idx": 20, "text_start": 100, "text_end": 107, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It's comical how horrifically built the Phillies bullpen is. We may actually die one thousand deaths before Labor Day", "tokens": ["It's", "comical", "how", "horrifically", "built", "the", "Phillies", "bullpen", "is", ".", "We", "may", "actually", "die", "one", "thousand", "deaths", "before", "Labor", "Day"], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 49, "text_end": 56, "date": "2021-06"}}
{"id": "4833df55", "word": "burnham", "tweet1": {"text": "I can't believe someone from burnham is using their instagram platform to discourage people from wearing masks and to not take this virus seriously. It's so irresponsible to actively discourage people from taking safety precautions", "tokens": ["I", "can't", "believe", "someone", "from", "burnham", "is", "using", "their", "instagram", "platform", "to", "discourage", "people", "from", "wearing", "masks", "and", "to", "not", "take", "this", "virus", "seriously", ".", "It's", "so", "irresponsible", "to", "actively", "discourage", "people", "from", "taking", "safety", "precautions"], "token_idx": 5, "text_start": 29, "text_end": 36, "date": "2020-08"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Every minute of every day there is a bo burnham song on loop inside my brain", "tokens": ["Every", "minute", "of", "every", "day", "there", "is", "a", "bo", "burnham", "song", "on", "loop", "inside", "my", "brain"], "token_idx": 9, "text_start": 40, "text_end": 47, "date": "2021-08"}}
{"id": "f9a6c48f", "word": "moxie", "tweet1": {"text": "What gives me hope during the Coronavirus outbreak? Our resiliency as human beings. Our toughness. Our moxie. Sure, they may be cancelling large events across the world, but that doesn't stop gatherings of ten, twenty, even FIFTY people every night at your mom's house.", "tokens": ["What", "gives", "me", "hope", "during", "the", "Coronavirus", "outbreak", "?", "Our", "resiliency", "as", "human", "beings", ".", "Our", "toughness", ".", "Our", "moxie", ".", "Sure", ",", "they", "may", "be", "cancelling", "large", "events", "across", "the", "world", ",", "but", "that", "doesn't", "stop", "gatherings", "of", "ten", ",", "twenty", ",", "even", "FIFTY", "people", "every", "night", "at", "your", "mom's", "house", "."], "token_idx": 19, "text_start": 103, "text_end": 108, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "I love UConn women's basketball but the Arizona pg is flat out taking it to them. Serious moxie and fun to watch.", "tokens": ["I", "love", "UConn", "women's", "basketball", "but", "the", "Arizona", "pg", "is", "flat", "out", "taking", "it", "to", "them", ".", "Serious", "moxie", "and", "fun", "to", "watch", "."], "token_idx": 18, "text_start": 90, "text_end": 95, "date": "2021-03"}}
{"id": "7470a196", "word": "moxie", "tweet1": {"text": "So once everyone whos sheltered in for two wks feels assured they arnt infected; Its going to take some moxie to choose to go back out into what may be environs where the contagion actively exists #OurExistentialConundrum", "tokens": ["So", "once", "everyone", "whos", "sheltered", "in", "for", "two", "wks", "feels", "assured", "they", "arnt", "infected", ";", "Its", "going", "to", "take", "some", "moxie", "to", "choose", "to", "go", "back", "out", "into", "what", "may", "be", "environs", "where", "the", "contagion", "actively", "exists", "#OurExistentialConundrum"], "token_idx": 20, "text_start": 104, "text_end": 109, "date": "2020-03"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It's so funny to me that when moxie came out my tl was full of so called feminists who felt empowered . I wanna see the same energy from those people now to use your voice. there are Muslim women who need our help, don't be silent!!", "tokens": ["It's", "so", "funny", "to", "me", "that", "when", "moxie", "came", "out", "my", "tl", "was", "full", "of", "so", "called", "feminists", "who", "felt", "empowered", ".", "I", "wanna", "see", "the", "same", "energy", "from", "those", "people", "now", "to", "use", "your", "voice", ".", "there", "are", "Muslim", "women", "who", "need", "our", "help", ",", "don't", "be", "silent", "!", "!"], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 30, "text_end": 35, "date": "2021-03"}}
