{"id": "d5e4afef", "word": "bullpen", "tweet1": {"text": "Martinez on assessing #Nationals 5th starter: \"I want to see who's going to be ready, and who's more apt to actually be able to pitch out of the bullpen if we need them because we're definitely going to need a long man.\" Fedde pitched today in game, Voth in \"next day or so.\"", "tokens": ["Martinez", "on", "assessing", "#Nationals", "5th", "starter", ":", "\"", "I", "want", "to", "see", "who's", "going", "to", "be", "ready", ",", "and", "who's", "more", "apt", "to", "actually", "be", "able", "to", "pitch", "out", "of", "the", "bullpen", "if", "we", "need", "them", "because", "we're", "definitely", "going", "to", "need", "a", "long", "man", ".", "\"", "Fedde", "pitched", "today", "in", "game", ",", "Voth", "in", "\"", "next", "day", "or", "so", ".", "\""], "token_idx": 31, "text_start": 145, "text_end": 152, "date": "2020-06"}, "tweet2": {"text": "It's comical how horrifically built the Phillies bullpen is. We may actually die one thousand deaths before Labor Day", "tokens": ["It's", "comical", "how", "horrifically", "built", "the", "Phillies", "bullpen", "is", ".", "We", "may", "actually", "die", "one", "thousand", "deaths", "before", "Labor", "Day"], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 49, "text_end": 56, "date": "2021-06"}}
{"id": "4072472a", "word": "pyre", "tweet1": {"text": "Some people choose to see the ugliness in this world. I choose to see the beauty. Value those precious moments of empathy, remember the meaning of life. Even as the world burns to cinders like a pyre, be a beacon of hope, a guide in the dark, a lighthouse. I believe in you. \ud83d\udd25", "tokens": ["Some", "people", "choose", "to", "see", "the", "ugliness", "in", "this", "world", ".", "I", "choose", "to", "see", "the", "beauty", ".", "Value", "those", "precious", "moments", "of", "empathy", ",", "remember", "the", "meaning", "of", "life", ".", "Even", "as", "the", "world", "burns", "to", "cinders", "like", "a", "pyre", ",", "be", "a", "beacon", "of", "hope", ",", "a", "guide", "in", "the", "dark", ",", "a", "lighthouse", ".", "I", "believe", "in", "you", ".", "\ud83d\udd25"], "token_idx": 40, "text_start": 195, "text_end": 199, "date": "2020-04"}, "tweet2": {"text": "Tech Ninja's Do and Don'ts of tech support #4 When you need to dispose of your old and expired electronics Do: Dispose of your expired electronics safely and recycle when possible Don't: Burn your electronics in a sacrificial pyre to the machine spirit", "tokens": ["Tech", "Ninja's", "Do", "and", "Don'ts", "of", "tech", "support", "#", "4", "When", "you", "need", "to", "dispose", "of", "your", "old", "and", "expired", "electronics", "Do:", "Dispose", "of", "your", "expired", "electronics", "safely", "and", "recycle", "when", "possible", "Don't", ":", "Burn", "your", "electronics", "in", "a", "sacrificial", "pyre", "to", "the", "machine", "spirit"], "token_idx": 40, "text_start": 226, "text_end": 230, "date": "2021-04"}}
