{"id": "7897904d", "word": "vanguard", "tweet1": {"text": "I think the strength of the moral vanguard of a society lies in whether the majority of people laugh at degenerate behaviour, or are disgusted by degen behaviour. If you merely laugh, that's acceptance. If you are disgusted, you actually want to defend moral &amp; social values.", "tokens": ["I", "think", "the", "strength", "of", "the", "moral", "vanguard", "of", "a", "society", "lies", "in", "whether", "the", "majority", "of", "people", "laugh", "at", "degenerate", "behaviour", ",", "or", "are", "disgusted", "by", "degen", "behaviour", ".", "If", "you", "merely", "laugh", ",", "that's", "acceptance", ".", "If", "you", "are", "disgusted", ",", "you", "actually", "want", "to", "defend", "moral", "&", "social", "values", "."], "token_idx": 7, "text_start": 34, "text_end": 42, "date": "2020-09"}, "tweet2": {"text": "According to Caleb, there are three conditions required for a revolution: 1) a massive crisis affecting all levels of society, 2) broad popular unrest against the government, and 3) a revolutionary vanguard organization to direct the energies of the masses. Where are we now?", "tokens": ["According", "to", "Caleb", ",", "there", "are", "three", "conditions", "required", "for", "a", "revolution", ":", "1", ")", "a", "massive", "crisis", "affecting", "all", "levels", "of", "society", ",", "2", ")", "broad", "popular", "unrest", "against", "the", "government", ",", "and", "3", ")", "a", "revolutionary", "vanguard", "organization", "to", "direct", "the", "energies", "of", "the", "masses", ".", "Where", "are", "we", "now", "?"], "token_idx": 38, "text_start": 198, "text_end": 206, "date": "2021-09"}}
